      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1 5  What these rules are about",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-1-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.15",
      "values:originalText": "(1)  These rules set out details of how the consumer data right works.\n(2) These rules should be read in conjunction with the following:\n(a) the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 (the Act), and in particular, Part\nIVD of the Act, which sets out the general framework for how the\nconsumer data right works;\n(b) designation instruments made under section 56AC of the Act;\n(c) guidelines made by the Information Commissioner under section 56EQ of\nthe Act;\n(d) data standards made under section 56FA of the Act;\n(e) regulations made under section 172 of the Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(1)  These rules set out details of how the consumer data right works.\n(2) These rules should be read in conjunction with the following:\n(a) the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 (the Act), and in particular, Part\nIVD of the Act, which sets out the general framework for how the\nconsumer data right works;\n(b) designation instruments made under section 56AC of the Act;\n(c) guidelines made by the Information Commissioner under section 56EQ of\nthe Act;\n(d) data standards made under section 56FA of the Act;\n(e) regulations made under section 172 of the Act.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-9-ss-1"
        },
        {
