      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 15,
      "values:originalText": "(2) These rules should be read in conjunction with the following:\n(a) the Competition and Consumer Act 2010 (the Act), and in particular, Part\nIVD of the Act, which sets out the general framework for how the\nconsumer data right works;\n(b) designation instruments made under section 56AC of the Act;\n(c) guidelines made by the Information Commissioner under section 56EQ of\nthe Act;\n(d) data standards made under section 56FA of the Act;\n(e) regulations made under section 172 of the Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-9-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Undertaking",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
