    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-1-10-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1(3) 6  Overview of these rules",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 15,
      "values:originalText": "(3) Part 3 of these rules deals with consumer data requests that are made by CDR\nconsumers, and should be read in conjunction with the relevant sector Schedule.\nOnly CDR consumers who are eligible to do so may make such requests. The\neligibility criteria for each sector are set out in the relevant sector Schedule."
    },
