      "cof:title": "1 6A  Sector Schedules",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 17,
      "values:originalText": "A sector Schedule may modify the operation of Parts 1 to 9 of these rules in\nrelation to a particular designated sector or sectors and a particular matter\n(whether or not a provision in any of those Parts provides for the Schedule to\ndeal with the matter).\nExample:\nA sector Schedule may provide that these rules do not apply in relation to a particular\nclass of data holders in the designated sector or sectors."
