      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.28",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For subparagraph (3)(a)(ii), the provision of the specified goods or services must\nbe:\n(a) where the OSP principal is the OSP chain principal—for the purpose of\nenabling the OSP chain principal to provide CDR consumers for the\nservice data with the goods and services for the purposes of which a\nrelevant consent to collect the service data, or the CDR data from which it\nwas directly or indirectly derived, was given; and\n(b) otherwise—for the purpose of enabling the OSP principal to provide the\ngoods and services specified in the CDR outsourcing arrangement for\nwhich it is the provider.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For subparagraph (3)(a)(ii), the provision of the specified goods or services must\nbe:\n(a) where the OSP principal is the OSP chain principal—for the purpose of\nenabling the OSP chain principal to provide CDR consumers for the\nservice data with the goods and services for the purposes of which a\nrelevant consent to collect the service data, or the CDR data from which it\nwas directly or indirectly derived, was given; and\n(b) otherwise—for the purpose of enabling the OSP principal to provide the\ngoods and services specified in the CDR outsourcing arrangement for\nwhich it is the provider.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-15"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-15-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-15-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "510ad62bddbd7895b22940dbcbc44dfc5b4afb904e475dce92d1b665710d8540",
      "skos:note": "OSP principal must provide goods and services for CDR data collection purposes.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-1-15-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1(4) 10  Meaning of direct OSP, indirect OSP and related terms",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 28,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For subparagraph (3)(a)(ii), the provision of the specified goods or services must\nbe:\n(a) where the OSP principal is the OSP chain principal—for the purpose of\nenabling the OSP chain principal to provide CDR consumers for the\nservice data with the goods and services for the purposes of which a\nrelevant consent to collect the service data, or the CDR data from which it\nwas directly or indirectly derived, was given; and\n(b) otherwise—for the purpose of enabling the OSP principal to provide the\ngoods and services specified in the CDR outsourcing arrangement for\nwhich it is the provider."
    },
