        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "def56812af3aa224a691617fffdf07335fd9bfc631296adbc9c57db06e7d30be",
      "skos:note": "Provide access to service data, delete records, and provide required documents.",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-1-15-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1(5) 10  Meaning of direct OSP, indirect OSP and related terms",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 28,
      "values:originalText": "(5) For subparagraph (3)(b)(v), the things are the following:\n(a) provide that person with access to any service data that it holds;\n(b) in accordance with the CDR data deletion process, delete any service data\nthat it holds and make the required records;\n(c) provide to that person any such required records;"
    },
    {
