    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-16-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1(2) 10AA  Meaning of CDR representative and related terms",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-1-16-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.30",
      "values:originalText": "(2) A CDR representative arrangement may provide for the CDR representative:\n(a) to seek any consent for the use or disclosure of service data that the CDR\nrepresentative principal could seek in the same circumstances; and\n(b) to make any use or disclosure of service data that would be:\n\n(i) a permitted use or disclosure of the CDR data of the kind mentioned\nin paragraph 7.5(1)(j); or\n(ii) a permitted use or disclosure of the CDR data that relates to direct\nmarketing of the kind mentioned in paragraph 7.5(3)(e).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) A CDR representative arrangement may provide for the CDR representative:\n(a) to seek any consent for the use or disclosure of service data that the CDR\nrepresentative principal could seek in the same circumstances; and\n(b) to make any use or disclosure of service data that would be:\n\n(i) a permitted use or disclosure of the CDR data of the kind mentioned\nin paragraph 7.5(1)(j); or\n(ii) a permitted use or disclosure of the CDR data that relates to direct\nmarketing of the kind mentioned in paragraph 7.5(3)(e).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-16"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-16-ss-2-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "90d006eebb728bef9ba5a168bc39a8f3606f9029f6dae82c2fd170ffff684539",
      "skos:note": "Permitted use or disclosure of service data"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-1-16-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1(2) 10AA  Meaning of CDR representative and related terms",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 30,
      "values:originalText": "(2) A CDR representative arrangement may provide for the CDR representative:\n(a) to seek any consent for the use or disclosure of service data that the CDR\nrepresentative principal could seek in the same circumstances; and\n(b) to make any use or disclosure of service data that would be:\n\n(i) a permitted use or disclosure of the CDR data of the kind mentioned\nin paragraph 7.5(1)(j); or\n(ii) a permitted use or disclosure of the CDR data that relates to direct\nmarketing of the kind mentioned in paragraph 7.5(3)(e)."
    },
