    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-16-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1(3) 10AA  Meaning of CDR representative and related terms",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-1-16-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.30",
      "values:originalText": "(3) A CDR representative arrangement must require the CDR representative:\n(a) not to enter into another CDR representative arrangement; and\n(b) not to engage a person as the provider in a CDR outsourcing arrangement\nin relation to service data except as provided in the CDR representative\narrangement.\nNote:\nBecause a CDR representative cannot collect CDR data except through its CDR\nrepresentative principal, it cannot engage the provider to collect CDR data.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) A CDR representative arrangement must require the CDR representative:\n(a) not to enter into another CDR representative arrangement; and\n(b) not to engage a person as the provider in a CDR outsourcing arrangement\nin relation to service data except as provided in the CDR representative\narrangement.\nNote:\nBecause a CDR representative cannot collect CDR data except through its CDR\nrepresentative principal, it cannot engage the provider to collect CDR data.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-16"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-16-ss-3-norm"
        },
