    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-19-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1(4) 10C  Trusted advisers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-1-19-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.36",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The accredited person or CDR representative must not make:\n(a) the nomination of a trusted adviser; or\n(b) the nomination of a particular person as a trusted adviser; or\n(c) the giving of a TA disclosure consent;\na condition for supply of the goods or services requested by the CDR consumer.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The accredited person or CDR representative must not make:\n(a) the nomination of a trusted adviser; or\n(b) the nomination of a particular person as a trusted adviser; or\n(c) the giving of a TA disclosure consent;\na condition for supply of the goods or services requested by the CDR consumer.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-19"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-19-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-19-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e18b5c8674b7fe68b4ed283c2e3e54621c70fc640052e5b3a8158055dd9f9ea9",
      "skos:note": "Cannot nominate a trusted adviser or give TA disclosure consent without condition."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-1-19-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1(4) 10C  Trusted advisers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 36,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The accredited person or CDR representative must not make:\n(a) the nomination of a trusted adviser; or\n(b) the nomination of a particular person as a trusted adviser; or\n(c) the giving of a TA disclosure consent;\na condition for supply of the goods or services requested by the CDR consumer."
    },
    {
