      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-19-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1(5) 10C  Trusted advisers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-1-19-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.36",
      "values:originalText": "(5) To avoid doubt, paragraphs (4)(a) and (c) do not apply where the only good or\nservice that is requested by the CDR consumer is for CDR data to be collected\nfrom a data holder and provided to a trusted adviser.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) To avoid doubt, paragraphs (4)(a) and (c) do not apply where the only good or\nservice that is requested by the CDR consumer is for CDR data to be collected\nfrom a data holder and provided to a trusted adviser.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-19"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-19-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-19-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-19-ss-5-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "29f9ae70b206e09683bc25b48ec03f41069f3c1141ba4b88c89c39b06442e108",
      "skos:note": "Exemption for CDR data collection from trusted adviser"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-1-19-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1(5) 10C  Trusted advisers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 36,
      "values:originalText": "(5) To avoid doubt, paragraphs (4)(a) and (c) do not apply where the only good or\nservice that is requested by the CDR consumer is for CDR data to be collected\nfrom a data holder and provided to a trusted adviser."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-19-ss-5-norm",
