      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.38",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A data holder does not contravene subrule (1) in relation to subparagraph\n(1)(a)(ii) so long as it takes reasonable steps to ensure that the online service\ncomplies with that subparagraph.\nSubdivision 1.4.3—Services for managing consumer data requests made\nby accredited persons",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A data holder does not contravene subrule (1) in relation to subparagraph\n(1)(a)(ii) so long as it takes reasonable steps to ensure that the online service\ncomplies with that subparagraph.\nSubdivision 1.4.3—Services for managing consumer data requests made\nby accredited persons",
      "values:partOf": {
