      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.43",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If an accredited person collects CDR data on behalf of another accredited person\n(the principal) as a direct or indirect OSP:\n(a) rules 7.4 and 7.9 apply only in relation to the principal; and\n(b) paragraph 7.10(1)(a) requires the principal to be identified.\nMeaning of required provision",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If an accredited person collects CDR data on behalf of another accredited person\n(the principal) as a direct or indirect OSP:\n(a) rules 7.4 and 7.9 apply only in relation to the principal; and\n(b) paragraph 7.10(1)(a) requires the principal to be identified.\nMeaning of required provision",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-26"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
