        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8e561c71b284bfca9b0e340e850a1930dd298d60ed45288151f1e74c1a13c094",
      "skos:note": "Principal must be identified in outsourcing arrangements"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-1-26-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1(5) 16  Obligations relating to outsourcing arrangements",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 43,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If an accredited person collects CDR data on behalf of another accredited person\n(the principal) as a direct or indirect OSP:\n(a) rules 7.4 and 7.9 apply only in relation to the principal; and\n(b) paragraph 7.10(1)(a) requires the principal to be identified.\nMeaning of required provision"
    },
    {
