      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.44",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If this is not possible, the accredited data recipient must delete the relevant data\nand any CDR data directly or indirectly derived from it in accordance with the\nCDR data deletion process.\nNote:\nFor the CDR data deletion process, see rule 1.18.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If this is not possible, the accredited data recipient must delete the relevant data\nand any CDR data directly or indirectly derived from it in accordance with the\nCDR data deletion process.\nNote:\nFor the CDR data deletion process, see rule 1.18.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-28"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
