      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 45,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Where the accredited data recipient has identified CDR data as redundant, it must\nidentify whether any of the following provisions of the Act apply to the CDR\ndata:\n(a) paragraphs 56BAA(2)(a), (b) or (c) of the Act (deletion request by\nconsumer);\n(b) paragraphs 56EO(2)(b) or (c) of the Act (privacy safeguard 12)."
    },
