      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.47",
      "values:originalText": "Note:\nThis rule relates to Division 3.2.\n(1) This rule applies where a CDR consumer proposes to make an SR data request.\n(2) The request must be made to the primary data holder, using the primary data\nholder’s direct request service.",
      "skos:definition": "Note:\nThis rule relates to Division 3.2.\n(1) This rule applies where a CDR consumer proposes to make an SR data request.\n(2) The request must be made to the primary data holder, using the primary data\nholder’s direct request service.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-34-ss-1"
        },
