          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-35-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f68f42a14af9e0b9d45002f1b6b5f0d6b21877b62e84aed35f60f86881f3f597",
      "skos:note": "Primary data holder must request secondary data holder to disclose SR data."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-1-35-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1(4) 23  SR data request by an accredited person",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 48,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If the CDR consumer authorises disclosure of requested data, the primary data\nholder must, using the service mentioned in subrule 1.20(2) and in accordance\nwith the data standards, request the secondary data holder to disclose any SR\ndata that the primary data holder needs in order to respond to the SR data\nrequest.\nNote:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)."
    },
