        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a926fecf45573c0370d8cba13b5343816a068c3b4e6665932cb5f8e2cf5c8952",
      "skos:note": "Secondary data holder must disclose SR data requested to primary data holder in accordance with relevant data standards.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-1-35-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1(5) 23  SR data request by an accredited person",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 48,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If the secondary data holder chooses to disclose the SR data requested to the\nprimary data holder, it must do so in accordance with any relevant data\nstandards.\n\n\nPreliminary  Part 1\nApplication of rules in relation to SR data  Division 1.5\nSection 1.24\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\nNote:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)."
    },
    {
