      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the secondary data holder chooses not to disclose the SR data requested to the\nprimary data holder, it must notify the primary data holder of its refusal.\nNote:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).\nResponding to the request",
      "skos:definition": "(6) If the secondary data holder chooses not to disclose the SR data requested to the\nprimary data holder, it must notify the primary data holder of its refusal.\nNote:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).\nResponding to the request",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-35"
      },
