        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-35-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e0d4da8981aa4b4ee464bef27c45c14b8abcd48b9b936998f65bb7de9747ec81",
      "skos:note": "Notify primary data holder of refusal to disclose SR data.",
      "dc:description": "Notification"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-1-35-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1(6) 23  SR data request by an accredited person",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 48,
      "values:originalText": "(6) If the secondary data holder chooses not to disclose the SR data requested to the\nprimary data holder, it must notify the primary data holder of its refusal.\nNote:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).\nResponding to the request"
    },
