      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.48",
      "values:originalText": "(9) Rule 4.7 (refusal to disclose) applies as if the primary data holder were the data\nholder for any SR data covered by the SR data request.\nNotification of withdrawal of consent",
      "skos:definition": "(9) Rule 4.7 (refusal to disclose) applies as if the primary data holder were the data\nholder for any SR data covered by the SR data request.\nNotification of withdrawal of consent",
