      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 48,
      "values:originalText": "(9) Rule 4.7 (refusal to disclose) applies as if the primary data holder were the data\nholder for any SR data covered by the SR data request.\nNotification of withdrawal of consent"
