    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-1-36-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1(2) Section 1",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 49,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Where a secondary data holder provides SR data to a primary data holder in\nresponse to such a request:\n(a) the primary data holder must not use or disclose the SR data for a purpose\nother than responding to the SR data request; and\n(b) once the primary data holder has responded to the SR data request, it must\ndelete any of the SR data that it holds in accordance with the CDR data\ndeletion process.\nNote :\nSee rule 1.18 for the definition of “CDR data deletion process”."
    },
    {
