    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2 3  Product data requests",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-2-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.51",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person may:\nPerson makes a request for product data using a data\nholder’s product data request service.\nFor any required product data, the data holder must\n(unless covered by an exception) disclose the data to\nthe requester.\nFor any voluntary product data, the data holder may,\nbut is not required to, disclose the data to the requester.\nIn either case, the data is disclosed through the data\nholder’s product data request service.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A person may:\nPerson makes a request for product data using a data\nholder’s product data request service.\nFor any required product data, the data holder must\n(unless covered by an exception) disclose the data to\nthe requester.\nFor any voluntary product data, the data holder may,\nbut is not required to, disclose the data to the requester.\nIn either case, the data is disclosed through the data\nholder’s product data request service.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-6-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "dfe7065ad9f6963801c0fa0b10e5ad6cc8305d8758c6cc6ffec5223f26df2f09",
      "skos:note": "Requester may obtain product data from a data holder."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-2-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2 3  Product data requests",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 51,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A person may:\nPerson makes a request for product data using a data\nholder’s product data request service.\nFor any required product data, the data holder must\n(unless covered by an exception) disclose the data to\nthe requester.\nFor any voluntary product data, the data holder may,\nbut is not required to, disclose the data to the requester.\nIn either case, the data is disclosed through the data\nholder’s product data request service."
    },
    {
