    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2(4) 4  Disclosing product data in response to product data request",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.52",
      "values:originalText": "(4) If:\n(a) a data holder (the first data holder) receives a request for CDR data that\nrelates to a product (the relevant product); and\n\n\nProduct data requests  Part 2\nApplication of rules in relation to SR data  Division 1.5\nSection 2.5\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\n(b) the first data holder offers the relevant product on behalf of another data\nholder (the second data holder), such that the second data holder is the\ndata holder that enters into contracts with consumers to provide the\nrelevant product;\nthe first data holder is not required to disclose the requested required product\ndata under subrule (3).",
      "skos:definition": "(4) If:\n(a) a data holder (the first data holder) receives a request for CDR data that\nrelates to a product (the relevant product); and\n\n\nProduct data requests  Part 2\nApplication of rules in relation to SR data  Division 1.5\nSection 2.5\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\n(b) the first data holder offers the relevant product on behalf of another data\nholder (the second data holder), such that the second data holder is the\ndata holder that enters into contracts with consumers to provide the\nrelevant product;\nthe first data holder is not required to disclose the requested required product\ndata under subrule (3).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-7"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-4-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2b4109b5e40f474e119128e7adc93e89a238553a06815e09b894df8362d68334",
      "skos:note": "Data holder not required to disclose requested product data under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2(4) 4  Disclosing product data in response to product data request",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 52,
      "values:originalText": "(4) If:\n(a) a data holder (the first data holder) receives a request for CDR data that\nrelates to a product (the relevant product); and\n\n\nProduct data requests  Part 2\nApplication of rules in relation to SR data  Division 1.5\nSection 2.5\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\n(b) the first data holder offers the relevant product on behalf of another data\nholder (the second data holder), such that the second data holder is the\ndata holder that enters into contracts with consumers to provide the\nrelevant product;\nthe first data holder is not required to disclose the requested required product\ndata under subrule (3)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-4-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-4"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2(5) 4  Disclosing product data in response to product data request",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.52",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If:\n(a) the second data holder receives such a request; and\n(b) the data holders have agreed in writing that, in such a case, the first data\nholder will disclose the requested required product data;\nthen:\n(c) subrule (3) applies as if:\n(i) it permitted the CDR data to be disclosed through the first data\nholder’s product data request service; and\n(ii) in the case that the first data holder disclosed CDR data in response to\nthe request―the reference to the data holder’s website in\nsub-subparagraph (3)(b)(ii)(A) was to the first data holder’s website;\nand\n(d) rule 2.6 applies as if it applied in relation to each of the first data holder\nand the second data holder.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If:\n(a) the second data holder receives such a request; and\n(b) the data holders have agreed in writing that, in such a case, the first data\nholder will disclose the requested required product data;\nthen:\n(c) subrule (3) applies as if:\n(i) it permitted the CDR data to be disclosed through the first data\nholder’s product data request service; and\n(ii) in the case that the first data holder disclosed CDR data in response to\nthe request―the reference to the data holder’s website in\nsub-subparagraph (3)(b)(ii)(A) was to the first data holder’s website;\nand\n(d) rule 2.6 applies as if it applied in relation to each of the first data holder\nand the second data holder.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-7"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-5-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-5-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-5-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-5-logic-argumentation-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6bbb648166e137082eb0264a65b10dce210e6561af273469a56f3cc7cab1ef18",
      "skos:note": "Data holder must disclose product data in response to request if agreed upon in writing.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2(5) 4  Disclosing product data in response to product data request",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 52,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If:\n(a) the second data holder receives such a request; and\n(b) the data holders have agreed in writing that, in such a case, the first data\nholder will disclose the requested required product data;\nthen:\n(c) subrule (3) applies as if:\n(i) it permitted the CDR data to be disclosed through the first data\nholder’s product data request service; and\n(ii) in the case that the first data holder disclosed CDR data in response to\nthe request―the reference to the data holder’s website in\nsub-subparagraph (3)(b)(ii)(A) was to the first data holder’s website;\nand\n(d) rule 2.6 applies as if it applied in relation to each of the first data holder\nand the second data holder."
    },
