    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2(6) 4  Disclosing product data in response to product data request",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.52",
      "values:originalText": "(6) In this rule, disclosure document includes:\n(a) a Product Disclosure Statement within the meaning of the Corporations\nAct 2001; or\n(b) a key facts sheet within the meaning of the National Consumer Credit\nProtection Act 2009; or\n(c) a similar document that is required by law to be disclosed to a customer\nprior to entering into a contract with that customer.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) In this rule, disclosure document includes:\n(a) a Product Disclosure Statement within the meaning of the Corporations\nAct 2001; or\n(b) a key facts sheet within the meaning of the National Consumer Credit\nProtection Act 2009; or\n(c) a similar document that is required by law to be disclosed to a customer\nprior to entering into a contract with that customer.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-7"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-6-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "77b0a222c8bab6602518516a21ce4a742416ffdaaa46671d0ef70690e22e5b11",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure document must include specific documents",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-2-7-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2(6) 4  Disclosing product data in response to product data request",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 52,
      "values:originalText": "(6) In this rule, disclosure document includes:\n(a) a Product Disclosure Statement within the meaning of the Corporations\nAct 2001; or\n(b) a key facts sheet within the meaning of the National Consumer Credit\nProtection Act 2009; or\n(c) a similar document that is required by law to be disclosed to a customer\nprior to entering into a contract with that customer."
    },
