    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2 5  Refusal to disclose required product data in response to product data",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-2-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.53",
      "values:originalText": "request\n(1) Despite subrule 2.4(3), the data holder may refuse to disclose required product\ndata in response to the request in circumstances (if any) set out in the data\nstandards.\n(2) The data holder must inform the requester of such a refusal in accordance with\nthe data standards.\nCivil penalty:\n(a) for an individual―$50,000; and\n(b) for a body corporate―$250,000.",
      "skos:definition": "request\n(1) Despite subrule 2.4(3), the data holder may refuse to disclose required product\ndata in response to the request in circumstances (if any) set out in the data\nstandards.\n(2) The data holder must inform the requester of such a refusal in accordance with\nthe data standards.\nCivil penalty:\n(a) for an individual―$50,000; and\n(b) for a body corporate―$250,000.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-8-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-8-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1f58b9145b24d108d7ac38887338b3ea3229833b9c1e418250343f907bfd1047"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-2-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2 5  Refusal to disclose required product data in response to product data",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 53,
      "values:originalText": "request\n(1) Despite subrule 2.4(3), the data holder may refuse to disclose required product\ndata in response to the request in circumstances (if any) set out in the data\nstandards.\n(2) The data holder must inform the requester of such a refusal in accordance with\nthe data standards.\nCivil penalty:\n(a) for an individual―$50,000; and\n(b) for a body corporate―$250,000."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-8-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "2(1) 5  Refusal to disclose required product data in response to product data",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-2-8-ss-1"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
