      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.53",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Despite subrule 2.4(3), the data holder may refuse to disclose required product\ndata in response to the request in circumstances (if any) set out in the data\nstandards.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Despite subrule 2.4(3), the data holder may refuse to disclose required product\ndata in response to the request in circumstances (if any) set out in the data\nstandards.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-8"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-8-ss-1-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ed388b979fd5bcbcda06560884167c5e8ea19528ec8a07c116a19fa8dcc9b559",
      "skos:note": "Data holder may refuse to disclose required product data under certain circumstances."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-2-8-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2(1) 5  Refusal to disclose required product data in response to product data",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 53,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Despite subrule 2.4(3), the data holder may refuse to disclose required product\ndata in response to the request in circumstances (if any) set out in the data\nstandards."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-8-ss-1-norm",
