      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.53",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The data holder must inform the requester of such a refusal in accordance with\nthe data standards.\nCivil penalty:\n(a) for an individual―$50,000; and\n(b) for a body corporate―$250,000.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The data holder must inform the requester of such a refusal in accordance with\nthe data standards.\nCivil penalty:\n(a) for an individual―$50,000; and\n(b) for a body corporate―$250,000.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-8"
      },
