      "cml:integrityHash": "73419df31137746811926f19148bd8736fb373ea0b6944e13e851e933c87d041",
      "skos:note": "Request for disclosure of CDR data"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-3-6-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3(1) 3  Consumer data requests made by CDR consumers",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 56,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A CDR consumer may, using the data holder’s direct request service, request a\ndata holder to disclose some or all of their CDR data."
    },
