      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 56,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The data holder must, subject to rule 3.5, disclose any requested required\nconsumer data to the CDR consumer who made the request:\n(a) through its direct request service; and\n(b) in accordance with the data standards.\nNote 2:\nFor a request that relates to a joint account, see rules 4A.10 and 4A.15 for additional\ncircumstances in which data relating to the joint account might not be disclosed under\nthese rules.\nNote 3:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).\nNote 4:\nA fee cannot be charged for the disclosure of required consumer data: see section 56BU\nof the Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-3-7-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-3-7-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-3-7-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
