      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.59",
      "values:originalText": "flowchart\nThe following is a flowchart for how an accredited person makes a consumer\ndata request to a CDR participant under this Division.\nNote 2:\nAn accredited data recipient may ask the CDR consumer for a collection consent, use\nconsent and disclosure consent at the same time (see subrules 4.3(2) and (2A)).",
      "skos:definition": "flowchart\nThe following is a flowchart for how an accredited person makes a consumer\ndata request to a CDR participant under this Division.\nNote 2:\nAn accredited data recipient may ask the CDR consumer for a collection consent, use\nconsent and disclosure consent at the same time (see subrules 4.3(2) and (2A)).",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-8-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d0a2b43cd82cabcd0c1ae060f63e1dc089fa18743464cf4920d52f79f5ebc892",
      "skos:note": "Consumer data request flowchart"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 2  Consumer data requests made by accredited persons to CDR participants—",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 59,
      "values:originalText": "flowchart\nThe following is a flowchart for how an accredited person makes a consumer\ndata request to a CDR participant under this Division.\nNote 2:\nAn accredited data recipient may ask the CDR consumer for a collection consent, use\nconsent and disclosure consent at the same time (see subrules 4.3(2) and (2A))."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-8-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-8"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
