      },
      "cml:premiseText": "For any voluntary consumer data, the data holder may (but is not required to) ask the CDR consumer to authorise disclosure.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The data holder may disclose, to the accredited person, the voluntary consumer data it is authorised to disclose."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-1-logic-deontic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Accredited person must use and disclose CDR data upon request.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The accredited person may use and disclose the CDR data it collects as a result of the consumer data request, in accordance with the Act and these rules, to provide the requested goods and services to the CDR consumer, and as otherwise consented to by the CDR consumer.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The accredited person may use and disclose the CDR data it collects as a result of the consumer data request, in accordance with the Act and these rules, to provide the requested goods and services to the CDR consumer, and as otherwise consented to by the CDR consumer."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4(2) 3  Request for accredited person to seek to collect CDR data",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.60",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The accredited person may, in accordance with Division 4.3, ask the CDR\nconsumer to give:\n(a) a collection consent for the accredited person to collect their CDR data\nfrom the CDR participant; and\n(b) a use consent for the accredited person to use that CDR data;\nin order to provide those goods or services.\nNote 1: In order to provide goods or services in accordance with the CDR consumer’s request, it\nmight be necessary for the accredited person to request CDR data from more than 1\nCDR participant.\nNote 2: The CDR may be collected and used only in accordance with the data minimisation\nprinciple: see rule 1.8.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The accredited person may, in accordance with Division 4.3, ask the CDR\nconsumer to give:\n(a) a collection consent for the accredited person to collect their CDR data\nfrom the CDR participant; and\n(b) a use consent for the accredited person to use that CDR data;\nin order to provide those goods or services.\nNote 1: In order to provide goods or services in accordance with the CDR consumer’s request, it\nmight be necessary for the accredited person to request CDR data from more than 1\nCDR participant.\nNote 2: The CDR may be collected and used only in accordance with the data minimisation\nprinciple: see rule 1.8.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
