        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2-logic-ltl-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2-logic-argumentation-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "30e16af2c3c106adbc6d5a66d6dd0fd8cf174e0c9ae7d99879a45515ad739585",
      "skos:note": "Request for collection consent and use consent from CDR participant"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4(2) 3  Request for accredited person to seek to collect CDR data",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 60,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The accredited person may, in accordance with Division 4.3, ask the CDR\nconsumer to give:\n(a) a collection consent for the accredited person to collect their CDR data\nfrom the CDR participant; and\n(b) a use consent for the accredited person to use that CDR data;\nin order to provide those goods or services.\nNote 1: In order to provide goods or services in accordance with the CDR consumer’s request, it\nmight be necessary for the accredited person to request CDR data from more than 1\nCDR participant.\nNote 2: The CDR may be collected and used only in accordance with the data minimisation\nprinciple: see rule 1.8."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Permit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Granting permission to collect and use CDR data",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The accredited person may ask the CDR consumer for consent",
      "cml:conclusionText": "The CDR consumer must provide consent"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Overlaps",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal overlap between CDR data collection and service provision",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The accredited person may request CDR data from more than one CDR participant",
      "cml:conclusionText": "CDR data collection overlaps with service provision"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2-logic-ltl-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:LTL"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Until",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal relationship between CDR data collection and service provision",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::temporal_ltl",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The accredited person provides goods or services in accordance with the CDR consumer's request",
      "cml:conclusionText": "CDR data collection is until service provision"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Diffuses",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Diffusion of CDR data through service provision",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The accredited person uses CDR data to provide goods or services",
      "cml:conclusionText": "CDR data diffuses through service provision"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2-logic-argumentation-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Implication",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Implication of CDR data collection on service provision",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The accredited person requests CDR data from the CDR participant",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Service provision implies CDR data collection"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2a",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4(2A) 3  Request for accredited person to seek to collect CDR data",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2a"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.60",
      "values:originalText": "(2A) The accredited person may also ask a CDR consumer to give a disclosure\nconsent in relation to CDR data, either:\n(a) at the same time the accredited person asks the CDR consumer to give a\ncollection consent under subrule (2) in relation to CDR data; or\n(b) after the CDR consumer has given a collection consent requested under\nsubrule (2) in relation to the CDR data whether or not the CDR has yet\nbeen collected.\nNote 1:\nRequests for collection consent, use consent and disclosure consent may be bundled\ntogether (see subrules 4.3(2) and (2A).\nNote 2:\nThe CDR data may be disclosed only in accordance with the data minimisation\nprinciple: see rule 1.8.",
      "skos:definition": "(2A) The accredited person may also ask a CDR consumer to give a disclosure\nconsent in relation to CDR data, either:\n(a) at the same time the accredited person asks the CDR consumer to give a\ncollection consent under subrule (2) in relation to CDR data; or\n(b) after the CDR consumer has given a collection consent requested under\nsubrule (2) in relation to the CDR data whether or not the CDR has yet\nbeen collected.\nNote 1:\nRequests for collection consent, use consent and disclosure consent may be bundled\ntogether (see subrules 4.3(2) and (2A).\nNote 2:\nThe CDR data may be disclosed only in accordance with the data minimisation\nprinciple: see rule 1.8.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2a-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2a-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ac94f739c0cc5d7ffe5bc0325ad1a81f97df6476a19c075e47e52622e4406861",
      "skos:note": "Request for disclosure consent from CDR consumer"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2a",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4(2A) 3  Request for accredited person to seek to collect CDR data",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 60,
      "values:originalText": "(2A) The accredited person may also ask a CDR consumer to give a disclosure\nconsent in relation to CDR data, either:\n(a) at the same time the accredited person asks the CDR consumer to give a\ncollection consent under subrule (2) in relation to CDR data; or\n(b) after the CDR consumer has given a collection consent requested under\nsubrule (2) in relation to the CDR data whether or not the CDR has yet\nbeen collected.\nNote 1:\nRequests for collection consent, use consent and disclosure consent may be bundled\ntogether (see subrules 4.3(2) and (2A).\nNote 2:\nThe CDR data may be disclosed only in accordance with the data minimisation\nprinciple: see rule 1.8."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2a-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2a"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2a-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Permit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Granting permission to disclose CDR data",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The accredited person may also ask a CDR consumer..."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2b",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4(2B) 3  Request for accredited person to seek to collect CDR data",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2b"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.60",
      "values:originalText": "(2B) If the accredited person is an affiliate and the CDR data will be collected by a\nsponsor at its request:\n(a) the request for a collection consent must specify that fact; and\n(b) a consent for the affiliate to collect the CDR data is taken to be consent for\nthe sponsor to so collect it.",
      "skos:definition": "(2B) If the accredited person is an affiliate and the CDR data will be collected by a\nsponsor at its request:\n(a) the request for a collection consent must specify that fact; and\n(b) a consent for the affiliate to collect the CDR data is taken to be consent for\nthe sponsor to so collect it.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2b-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2b-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "256c9ffe65a6e121e75931fde831bd2bc165391af79e55d8884dce66bef010cb",
      "skos:note": "Consent for sponsor to collect CDR data is implied if affiliate collects it at sponsor's request."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2b",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4(2B) 3  Request for accredited person to seek to collect CDR data",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 60,
      "values:originalText": "(2B) If the accredited person is an affiliate and the CDR data will be collected by a\nsponsor at its request:\n(a) the request for a collection consent must specify that fact; and\n(b) a consent for the affiliate to collect the CDR data is taken to be consent for\nthe sponsor to so collect it."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2b-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2b"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-2b-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Permit",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Consent for sponsor to collect CDR data is implied if affiliate collects it at sponsor's request.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4(3) 3  Request for accredited person to seek to collect CDR data",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.60",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In giving the consents, the CDR consumer gives the accredited person a valid\nrequest to seek to collect that CDR data from the CDR participant.\nNote:\nIf the accredited person seeks to collect CDR data under this Part without a valid\nrequest, it will contravene privacy safeguard 3 (a civil penalty provision under the Act):\nsee section 56EF of the Act.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In giving the consents, the CDR consumer gives the accredited person a valid\nrequest to seek to collect that CDR data from the CDR participant.\nNote:\nIf the accredited person seeks to collect CDR data under this Part without a valid\nrequest, it will contravene privacy safeguard 3 (a civil penalty provision under the Act):\nsee section 56EF of the Act.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "1079ca4ab52b2fd5ef85983994738b0c7c455380932b59203ceb9caf4201289a",
      "skos:note": "Request to collect CDR data from CDR participant"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4(3) 3  Request for accredited person to seek to collect CDR data",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 60,
      "values:originalText": "(3) In giving the consents, the CDR consumer gives the accredited person a valid\nrequest to seek to collect that CDR data from the CDR participant.\nNote:\nIf the accredited person seeks to collect CDR data under this Part without a valid\nrequest, it will contravene privacy safeguard 3 (a civil penalty provision under the Act):\nsee section 56EF of the Act."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
