    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4(5) 3  Request for accredited person to seek to collect CDR data",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.60",
      "values:originalText": "(5) If an accredited person asks for a CDR consumer’s consents for the purpose of\nmaking a consumer data request under this Part, the accredited person must do so\nin accordance with Division 4.3.\nNote:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).",
      "skos:definition": "(5) If an accredited person asks for a CDR consumer’s consents for the purpose of\nmaking a consumer data request under this Part, the accredited person must do so\nin accordance with Division 4.3.\nNote:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f36ddd0275b0f5fa5b5825d84ce5f76cbd90e6a97a62a5fd3223ab151063af8b",
      "skos:note": "Accredited person must seek CDR consumer's consent in accordance with Division 4.3."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4(5) 3  Request for accredited person to seek to collect CDR data",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 60,
      "values:originalText": "(5) If an accredited person asks for a CDR consumer’s consents for the purpose of\nmaking a consumer data request under this Part, the accredited person must do so\nin accordance with Division 4.3.\nNote:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-9-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
