        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-2-logic-argumentation-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-2-logic-diffusion-4"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-2-logic-n3logic-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ba4b37325d394afd7bad0422c914eee0f4e51083de0f6c1404962e84d635aea0",
      "skos:note": "Request for collection and use of CDR data"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4(2) Section 4",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 62,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The CDR representative may, in accordance with Division 4.3A, ask the CDR\nconsumer to give:\n(a) a collection consent for the CDR representative principal to collect the\nCDR consumer’s CDR data from the CDR participant and disclose it to the\nCDR representative; and\n(b) a use consent for the CDR representative to use it in order to provide those\ngoods or services.\nNote 1:\nFor a collection consent mentioned in paragraph (a), see subrule 1.10A(8).\nFor consents mentioned in paragraph (b), see rule 1.10A as applied to a CDR\nrepresentative under subrule 1.10A(5).\nNote 2:\nIn order to provide goods or services in accordance with the CDR consumer’s request,\nit might be necessary for the CDR representative principal to request CDR data from\nmore than 1 CDR participant.\nNote 3:\nThe CDR data may be collected and used only in accordance with the data\nminimisation principle: see rule 1.8."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-2"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-2-logic-deontic-1",
