      "cml:logicSummary": "Request for permission to collect and use CDR data",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-2-logic-alleninterval-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:AllenInterval"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Within",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Temporal interval for data collection and use",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::interval_reasoning",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "In order to provide goods or services in accordance with the CDR consumer’s request, it might be necessary for the CDR representative principal to request CDR data from more than 1 CDR participant."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-2-logic-argumentation-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Argumentation"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Implication",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Implication of collection consent on data use",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::argumentation",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "For consents mentioned in paragraph (b), see rule 1.10A as applied to a CDR representative under subrule 1.10A(5)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-2-logic-diffusion-4",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Diffusion"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Propagation",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Propagating the request for collection and use of CDR data",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::diffusion",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The CDR data may be collected and used only in accordance with the data minimisation principle: see rule 1.8."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-2-logic-n3logic-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:N3Logic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Subsumes",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Subsumption of request under data minimisation principle",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::n3_compiler",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 0.5,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "The CDR data may be collected and used only in accordance with the data minimisation principle: see rule 1.8."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4(3) Section 4",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.62",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The CDR representative may also ask a CDR consumer to give a disclosure\nconsent in relation to CDR data, either:\n(a) at the same time the CDR representative asks the CDR consumer to give a\ncollection consent under subrule (2) in relation to the CDR data; or\n(b) after the CDR consumer has given a collection consent requested under\nsubrule (2) in relation to the CDR data whether or not the CDR data has yet\nbeen collected.\nNote 1:\nRequests for collection consent, use consent and disclosure consent may be bundled\ntogether (see subrules 4.3A(2) and (3).\nNote 2:\nThe CDR data may be disclosed only in accordance with the data minimisation\nprinciple: see rule 1.8.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The CDR representative may also ask a CDR consumer to give a disclosure\nconsent in relation to CDR data, either:\n(a) at the same time the CDR representative asks the CDR consumer to give a\ncollection consent under subrule (2) in relation to the CDR data; or\n(b) after the CDR consumer has given a collection consent requested under\nsubrule (2) in relation to the CDR data whether or not the CDR data has yet\nbeen collected.\nNote 1:\nRequests for collection consent, use consent and disclosure consent may be bundled\ntogether (see subrules 4.3A(2) and (3).\nNote 2:\nThe CDR data may be disclosed only in accordance with the data minimisation\nprinciple: see rule 1.8.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9c10a33c9b242d3c23a568be5fde5dcb9daed88c5bff3a9a93df6b8405e669de",
      "skos:note": "Request for disclosure consent may be bundled with collection and use consent."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4(3) Section 4",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 62,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The CDR representative may also ask a CDR consumer to give a disclosure\nconsent in relation to CDR data, either:\n(a) at the same time the CDR representative asks the CDR consumer to give a\ncollection consent under subrule (2) in relation to the CDR data; or\n(b) after the CDR consumer has given a collection consent requested under\nsubrule (2) in relation to the CDR data whether or not the CDR data has yet\nbeen collected.\nNote 1:\nRequests for collection consent, use consent and disclosure consent may be bundled\ntogether (see subrules 4.3A(2) and (3).\nNote 2:\nThe CDR data may be disclosed only in accordance with the data minimisation\nprinciple: see rule 1.8."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Permission",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-10-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
