      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 66,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The data holder must inform the accredited person of such a refusal in\naccordance with the data standards.\nCivil penalty:\n(a) for an individual―$50,000; and\n(b) for a body corporate―$250,000.\nSubdivision 4.2.4—Consumer data requests by accredited persons to\naccredited data recipients"
    },
