      "cof:title": "4 7A  Consumer data request by accredited person to accredited data recipient",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 66,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If:\n(a) a CDR consumer has given an accredited person a request under rule 4.3 or"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-18-norm",
