        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7656123e71e4b675d4e12897b172a3149168aae69bfe1329f95ba1dba760fe21",
      "skos:note": "Accredited data recipient may ask CDR consumer for AP disclosure consent."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-20-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4(2) 7B  Accredited data recipient may ask eligible CDR consumer for AP",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 67,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The accredited data recipient may, in accordance with Division 4.3, ask the CDR\nconsumer for such an AP disclosure consent.\nNote:\nIf the CDR consumer consents to the disclosure, the accredited data recipient is\nauthorised (but not required) to disclose the requested CDR data to the accredited\nperson: see paragraph 7.5(1)(h) and rules 7.6, 7.7 and 7.8."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-20-ss-2-norm",
