      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.67",
      "values:originalText": "(3) If an accredited data recipient asks for an AP disclosure consent for the purposes\nof subrule (2), it must do so in accordance with Division 4.3.\nNote:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) If an accredited data recipient asks for an AP disclosure consent for the purposes\nof subrule (2), it must do so in accordance with Division 4.3.\nNote:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).",
      "values:partOf": {
