      "skos:note": "Must provide AP disclosure consent in accordance with Division 4.3.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-20-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4(3) 7B  Accredited data recipient may ask eligible CDR consumer for AP",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 67,
      "values:originalText": "(3) If an accredited data recipient asks for an AP disclosure consent for the purposes\nof subrule (2), it must do so in accordance with Division 4.3.\nNote:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-20-ss-3-norm",
