      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.72",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The accredited person must not, for an invitation to amend the period referred to\nin paragraph 4.11(1)(b):\n(a) give the invitation any earlier than a reasonable period before the current\nconsent is expected to expire; or\n(b) give more than a reasonable number of such invitations within this period.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The accredited person must not, for an invitation to amend the period referred to\nin paragraph 4.11(1)(b):\n(a) give the invitation any earlier than a reasonable period before the current\nconsent is expected to expire; or\n(b) give more than a reasonable number of such invitations within this period.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-27"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-27-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-27-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "f6999ede492966fcd5517e4d00a5d423368ff2babc909c4f6ccfb3e61d27b220",
      "skos:note": "Accredited person cannot give invitations to amend consent too early or too frequently."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-27-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4(4) 12B  Inviting CDR consumer to amend consent",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 72,
      "values:originalText": "(4) The accredited person must not, for an invitation to amend the period referred to\nin paragraph 4.11(1)(b):\n(a) give the invitation any earlier than a reasonable period before the current\nconsent is expected to expire; or\n(b) give more than a reasonable number of such invitations within this period."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-27-ss-4-norm",
