      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.74",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A consent given under this Division expires at the earliest of the following:\n(a) if the consent is withdrawn in accordance with paragraph 4.13(1)(b)―the\nearlier of the following:\n(i) when the accredited person gave effect to the withdrawal;\n(ii) 2 business days after the accredited person received the\ncommunication;\n(b) if the consent is withdrawn in accordance with paragraph",
