      "skos:definition": "(5) If an accredited person becomes a data holder, rather than an accredited data\nrecipient, of particular CDR data as a result of subsection 56AJ(4) of the Act, all\nof that accredited person’s consents given under this Division that relate to that\nCDR data expire.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-31"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
