      "values:originalText": "(5) If an accredited person becomes a data holder, rather than an accredited data\nrecipient, of particular CDR data as a result of subsection 56AJ(4) of the Act, all\nof that accredited person’s consents given under this Division that relate to that\nCDR data expire."
