      "cml:premiseText": "(6) If an accredited person’s accreditation is revoked or surrendered in accordance with rule 5.17, all of the accredited person’s consents expire when the revocation or surrender takes effect.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Consents expire upon revocation or surrender of accreditation."
