      },
      "cml:premiseText": "(6) If an accredited person’s accreditation is revoked or surrendered in accordance with rule 5.17, all of the accredited person’s consents expire when the revocation or surrender takes effect.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Information diffuses from accreditation revocation/surrender to consent expiration."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-31-ss-6-logic-cogai-5",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
