      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.78",
      "values:originalText": "(1) An accredited person must update a CDR consumer’s consumer dashboard as\nsoon as practicable after the information required to be contained on the\ndashboard changes.\nNote:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).",
      "skos:definition": "(1) An accredited person must update a CDR consumer’s consumer dashboard as\nsoon as practicable after the information required to be contained on the\ndashboard changes.\nNote:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).",
      "values:partOf": {
