      "skos:definition": "(1) This rule applies in relation to a collection consent, use consent or disclosure\nconsent given under this Division if:\n(a) the consent is current; and\n(b) 90 days have elapsed since the latest of the following:\n(i) the CDR consumer gave the consent;\n(ia) the CDR consumer last amended the consent;\n(ii) the CDR consumer last used their consumer dashboard;\n(iii) the accredited person last notified the CDR consumer that the consent\nis still current.",
