      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.80",
      "values:originalText": "20F. A failure to do so could result in the CDR representative principal being liable for one or more\ncivil penalty provisions: see section 56EF of the Act and rule 1.16A.",
      "skos:definition": "20F. A failure to do so could result in the CDR representative principal being liable for one or more\ncivil penalty provisions: see section 56EF of the Act and rule 1.16A.",
