      "skos:note": "Failure to comply may result in civil penalty"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-46",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 Section 4",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 80,
      "values:originalText": "20F. A failure to do so could result in the CDR representative principal being liable for one or more\ncivil penalty provisions: see section 56EF of the Act and rule 1.16A."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-46-norm",
