      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 84,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The CDR representative may give the invitation:\n(a) if the CDR representative principal’s consumer dashboard allows an\namendment to a consent in accordance with subrule 1.14(2A)―via the\nconsumer dashboard; or\n(b) in writing directly to the CDR consumer.\nNote:\nThe CDR representative principal may allow the CDR representative to provide the\nconsumer dashboard on its behalf—see subrule 1.14(5)."
    },
