    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-52-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4(3) 20H  Inviting CDR consumer to amend consent",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-52-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.84",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The CDR representative may invite a CDR consumer to amend a current consent\nif:\n(a) the amendment would better enable the CDR representative to provide the\ngoods or services referred to in paragraph 4.3A(1)(a); or\n(b) the amendment would:\n(i) be consequential to an agreement between the CDR representative and\nthe CDR consumer to modify those goods or services; and\n(ii) enable the CDR representative to provide the modified goods or\nservices.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The CDR representative may invite a CDR consumer to amend a current consent\nif:\n(a) the amendment would better enable the CDR representative to provide the\ngoods or services referred to in paragraph 4.3A(1)(a); or\n(b) the amendment would:\n(i) be consequential to an agreement between the CDR representative and\nthe CDR consumer to modify those goods or services; and\n(ii) enable the CDR representative to provide the modified goods or\nservices.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-52"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-52-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-52-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-52-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "06fed22e402efe54742d6fa924bb5f1657e323143a67315e56102ab5532f64b5",
      "skos:note": "Invite CDR consumer to amend consent under certain conditions."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-52-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4(3) 20H  Inviting CDR consumer to amend consent",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 84,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The CDR representative may invite a CDR consumer to amend a current consent\nif:\n(a) the amendment would better enable the CDR representative to provide the\ngoods or services referred to in paragraph 4.3A(1)(a); or\n(b) the amendment would:\n(i) be consequential to an agreement between the CDR representative and\nthe CDR consumer to modify those goods or services; and\n(ii) enable the CDR representative to provide the modified goods or\nservices."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-52-ss-3-norm",
