      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.89",
      "values:originalText": "(4) The notification may also be included in the CDR representative principal’s\nconsumer dashboard.\nNote:\nThe CDR representative principal may allow the CDR representative to provide the\nconsumer dashboard on its behalf—see subrule 1.14(5).",
      "skos:definition": "(4) The notification may also be included in the CDR representative principal’s\nconsumer dashboard.\nNote:\nThe CDR representative principal may allow the CDR representative to provide the\nconsumer dashboard on its behalf—see subrule 1.14(5).",
