      "skos:definition": "(2) The CDR representative principal must, as soon as practicable, make those\nchanges.\nNote 1:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).\nNote 2:\nThe CDR representative principal could arrange for the CDR representative to update\nthe consumer dashboard on the CDR representative principal’s behalf: see subrule",
