      "values:originalText": "(1) If a data holder has received a notice under rule 4.18C or 4.20S, the data holder\nmust, in accordance with this Division, invite the CDR consumer to amend the\nauthorisation to disclose CDR data accordingly.\nNote:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).\n(2) An amendment of an authorisation to disclose CDR data other than in\naccordance with subrule (1) is of no effect."
    },
