    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-77-ss-1",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4(1) 25  Withdrawal of authorisation to disclose CDR data",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 93,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A CDR consumer who has given an authorisation to a data holder to disclose\nparticular CDR data to an accredited person may withdraw the authorisation at\nany time:\n(a) by using the data holder’s consumer dashboard; or\n(b) by using a simple alternative method of communication to be made\navailable by the data holder for that purpose."
