    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4A 5  Disclosure options for joint accounts",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4a-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.97",
      "values:originalText": "Disclosure options\n(1) Disclosure of joint account data may be authorised only as permitted by the\ndisclosure option that applies to the joint account.  This may be any of the\nfollowing:\n(a) the pre-approval option, under which joint account data may be disclosed\nin response to a valid consumer data request on the authorisation of the\nrequester without the approval of the relevant account holders;\n(b) the co-approval option, under which joint account data may be disclosed in\nresponse to a valid consumer data request only after:\n(i) the requester has authorised the disclosure; and\n(ii) each of the relevant joint account holders has approved the disclosure;",
      "skos:definition": "Disclosure options\n(1) Disclosure of joint account data may be authorised only as permitted by the\ndisclosure option that applies to the joint account.  This may be any of the\nfollowing:\n(a) the pre-approval option, under which joint account data may be disclosed\nin response to a valid consumer data request on the authorisation of the\nrequester without the approval of the relevant account holders;\n(b) the co-approval option, under which joint account data may be disclosed in\nresponse to a valid consumer data request only after:\n(i) the requester has authorised the disclosure; and\n(ii) each of the relevant joint account holders has approved the disclosure;",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-6-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0e48d73d4909a78b772fdfa55ceb7a203ea8cd7eafe86776c8eb2c40fbf12b7c",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of joint account data may be authorised only as permitted by the disclosure option that applies to the joint account."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4a-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4A 5  Disclosure options for joint accounts",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 97,
      "values:originalText": "Disclosure options\n(1) Disclosure of joint account data may be authorised only as permitted by the\ndisclosure option that applies to the joint account.  This may be any of the\nfollowing:\n(a) the pre-approval option, under which joint account data may be disclosed\nin response to a valid consumer data request on the authorisation of the\nrequester without the approval of the relevant account holders;\n(b) the co-approval option, under which joint account data may be disclosed in\nresponse to a valid consumer data request only after:\n(i) the requester has authorised the disclosure; and\n(ii) each of the relevant joint account holders has approved the disclosure;"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-6-norm",
