      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-7-ss-5-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to provide disclosure option management service",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-7-ss-6",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4A(6) 6  Obligation to provide disclosure option management service",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4a-7-ss-6"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.98",
      "values:originalText": "(6) The service must not do any of the following in relation to the processes that it\nprovides for changing or proposing to change the disclosure option that applies\nto the joint account, or responding to such a proposal (the processes):\n\n\nJoint accounts  Part 4A\nDisclosure options  Division 4A.2\nSection 4A.7\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\n(a) add any requirements to the processes beyond those specified in the data\nstandards and these rules;\n(b) offer additional or alternative services as part of the processes;\n(c) include or refer to other documents, or provide any other information, so as\nto reduce comprehensibility;\n(d) offer any pre-selected options.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) The service must not do any of the following in relation to the processes that it\nprovides for changing or proposing to change the disclosure option that applies\nto the joint account, or responding to such a proposal (the processes):\n\n\nJoint accounts  Part 4A\nDisclosure options  Division 4A.2\nSection 4A.7\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\n(a) add any requirements to the processes beyond those specified in the data\nstandards and these rules;\n(b) offer additional or alternative services as part of the processes;\n(c) include or refer to other documents, or provide any other information, so as\nto reduce comprehensibility;\n(d) offer any pre-selected options.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-7"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-7-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-7-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-7-ss-6-logic-deontic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4f2fe88e048470fd84a890c63ce3a8e956b6d16ca6ad1112f2d2b747aa0d8ee7",
      "skos:note": "Service must not do certain actions in relation to changing disclosure options."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4a-7-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4A(6) 6  Obligation to provide disclosure option management service",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 98,
      "values:originalText": "(6) The service must not do any of the following in relation to the processes that it\nprovides for changing or proposing to change the disclosure option that applies\nto the joint account, or responding to such a proposal (the processes):\n\n\nJoint accounts  Part 4A\nDisclosure options  Division 4A.2\nSection 4A.7\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\n(a) add any requirements to the processes beyond those specified in the data\nstandards and these rules;\n(b) offer additional or alternative services as part of the processes;\n(c) include or refer to other documents, or provide any other information, so as\nto reduce comprehensibility;\n(d) offer any pre-selected options."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-7-ss-6-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
