    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-10",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4A 9  Application of Division",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4a-10"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.101",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This Division applies in relation to a consumer data request to a data holder\nunder Part 4 where the CDR data requested includes joint account data.\n(2) If the CDR data requested includes joint account data in relation to more than\none joint account, this Division applies separately in relation to each such joint\naccount.\n(3) In this Division a reference to a consumer data request is a reference to the\nconsumer data request only to the extent that it relates to a particular joint\naccount.\nSubdivision 4A.3.2—How consumer data requests to data holders under\nPart 4 that relate to joint accounts are handled",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This Division applies in relation to a consumer data request to a data holder\nunder Part 4 where the CDR data requested includes joint account data.\n(2) If the CDR data requested includes joint account data in relation to more than\none joint account, this Division applies separately in relation to each such joint\naccount.\n(3) In this Division a reference to a consumer data request is a reference to the\nconsumer data request only to the extent that it relates to a particular joint\naccount.\nSubdivision 4A.3.2—How consumer data requests to data holders under\nPart 4 that relate to joint accounts are handled",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-10-ss-1"
