      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.101",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In this Division a reference to a consumer data request is a reference to the\nconsumer data request only to the extent that it relates to a particular joint\naccount.\nSubdivision 4A.3.2—How consumer data requests to data holders under\nPart 4 that relate to joint accounts are handled",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In this Division a reference to a consumer data request is a reference to the\nconsumer data request only to the extent that it relates to a particular joint\naccount.\nSubdivision 4A.3.2—How consumer data requests to data holders under\nPart 4 that relate to joint accounts are handled",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-10"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-10-ss-3-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a9790610bab6898fa0831be1bd5e110b83aad39b8d6a990b9c78873fc5866605",
      "skos:note": "Consumer data request handling for joint accounts"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4a-10-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4A(3) 9  Application of Division",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 101,
      "values:originalText": "(3) In this Division a reference to a consumer data request is a reference to the\nconsumer data request only to the extent that it relates to a particular joint\naccount.\nSubdivision 4A.3.2—How consumer data requests to data holders under\nPart 4 that relate to joint accounts are handled"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-10-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
