      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.101",
      "values:originalText": "(b) if the authorisation is given, invite the approval of the relevant account\nholders in accordance with rule 4A.11; and\n(c) if all the relevant account holders give their approval, or are taken to have\ngiven their approval, comply with rules 4.6 to 4.7.\nNote:\nThe data holder must provide each relevant account holder with a consumer dashboard\nin accordance with rule 4A.13.\n(5) If a relevant account holder who approved the disclosure in accordance with rule",
      "skos:definition": "(b) if the authorisation is given, invite the approval of the relevant account\nholders in accordance with rule 4A.11; and\n(c) if all the relevant account holders give their approval, or are taken to have\ngiven their approval, comply with rules 4.6 to 4.7.\nNote:\nThe data holder must provide each relevant account holder with a consumer dashboard\nin accordance with rule 4A.13.\n(5) If a relevant account holder who approved the disclosure in accordance with rule",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-84-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-84-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "93b823ee92764537f36bb7e7802f67e36208e10cbe3b67cef6e436a695f58e8c",
      "skos:note": "Comply with rules 4.6 to 4.7 if all account holders approve."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-84",
