    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-14",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4A 12  Continuation and removal of approvals",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4a-14"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.102",
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a relevant account holder:\n(a) approves of the disclosure of joint account data in accordance with this\nDivision; or\n(b) is taken to have approved of the disclosure under the pre-approval option;\nthe approval is taken to apply while the authorisation referred to in paragraph",
      "skos:definition": "(1) If a relevant account holder:\n(a) approves of the disclosure of joint account data in accordance with this\nDivision; or\n(b) is taken to have approved of the disclosure under the pre-approval option;\nthe approval is taken to apply while the authorisation referred to in paragraph",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-14-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4a-14-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "47ab0593d4c31e3f7bcfd59caa7af8d9bd54b15e1f2074831c4bda101bac0408",
      "skos:note": "Approval of disclosure of joint account data is taken to apply while the authorisation referred to in paragraph 1."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4a-14",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4A 12  Continuation and removal of approvals",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 102,
      "values:originalText": "(1) If a relevant account holder:\n(a) approves of the disclosure of joint account data in accordance with this\nDivision; or\n(b) is taken to have approved of the disclosure under the pre-approval option;\nthe approval is taken to apply while the authorisation referred to in paragraph"
    },
    {
