      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.106",
      "values:originalText": "(3) The person must not make a consumer data request under these rules otherwise\nthan:\n(a) to an accredited data recipient under rule 4.7A; or\n(b) through a registered sponsor acting at its request under the sponsorship\narrangement.\nNote:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The person must not make a consumer data request under these rules otherwise\nthan:\n(a) to an accredited data recipient under rule 4.7A; or\n(b) through a registered sponsor acting at its request under the sponsorship\narrangement.\nNote:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-5"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-5-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-5-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c38f8abac28cc0e9679da7a0954f6ea26acc93ad2c95f6d8960164941cba6ae2",
      "skos:note": "Prohibition on making consumer data requests outside accredited data recipients or registered sponsors."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-5-5-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5(3) 1B  Sponsored accreditation",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 106,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The person must not make a consumer data request under these rules otherwise\nthan:\n(a) to an accredited data recipient under rule 4.7A; or\n(b) through a registered sponsor acting at its request under the sponsorship\narrangement.\nNote:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)."
    },
