    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-85",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4 14(1)(e):",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-85"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.106",
      "values:originalText": "(a) any collection consents for the person expire; however\n(b) any use consents and disclosure consents continue in effect.\nNote:\nIt is also possible for the accreditation to be suspended or revoked under item 11 of\nsubrule 5.17(1).\n(7) If the person has not had a registered sponsor for a period of 120 days, the\naccreditation is taken to have been surrendered.\nNote:\nSee subrule 4.14(6) and rule 5.23 for the effect of surrender of accreditation.\n(8) For this rule, a sponsor of the person is a registered sponsor if:\n(a) the sponsor has notified the CDR Accreditor in accordance with subrule",
      "skos:definition": "(a) any collection consents for the person expire; however\n(b) any use consents and disclosure consents continue in effect.\nNote:\nIt is also possible for the accreditation to be suspended or revoked under item 11 of\nsubrule 5.17(1).\n(7) If the person has not had a registered sponsor for a period of 120 days, the\naccreditation is taken to have been surrendered.\nNote:\nSee subrule 4.14(6) and rule 5.23 for the effect of surrender of accreditation.\n(8) For this rule, a sponsor of the person is a registered sponsor if:\n(a) the sponsor has notified the CDR Accreditor in accordance with subrule",
      "cml:hasPart": [
