    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5 3  CDR Accreditor may request further information",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-5-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.107",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The CDR Accreditor may request that the accreditation applicant provide further\ninformation to support the application.\n(2) Without limiting subrule (1), the CDR Accreditor may request the further\ninformation:\n(a) in writing; or\n(b) in an interview with the CDR Accreditor; or\n(c) by phone, email, videoconferencing or any other form of electronic\ncommunication.\nNote:\nIf the accreditation applicant does not provide the further information as requested\nunder this rule, the CDR Accreditor might not be in a position to be satisfied, under\nsection 56CA of the Act, that the applicant meets the criteria for accreditation.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The CDR Accreditor may request that the accreditation applicant provide further\ninformation to support the application.\n(2) Without limiting subrule (1), the CDR Accreditor may request the further\ninformation:\n(a) in writing; or\n(b) in an interview with the CDR Accreditor; or\n(c) by phone, email, videoconferencing or any other form of electronic\ncommunication.\nNote:\nIf the accreditation applicant does not provide the further information as requested\nunder this rule, the CDR Accreditor might not be in a position to be satisfied, under\nsection 56CA of the Act, that the applicant meets the criteria for accreditation.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-8-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-8-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3f757d53496950bc46e324c46d9870aeba19408dd830e61b4c17cab6ceec9c6a"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-5-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5 3  CDR Accreditor may request further information",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 107,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The CDR Accreditor may request that the accreditation applicant provide further\ninformation to support the application.\n(2) Without limiting subrule (1), the CDR Accreditor may request the further\ninformation:\n(a) in writing; or\n(b) in an interview with the CDR Accreditor; or\n(c) by phone, email, videoconferencing or any other form of electronic\ncommunication.\nNote:\nIf the accreditation applicant does not provide the further information as requested\nunder this rule, the CDR Accreditor might not be in a position to be satisfied, under\nsection 56CA of the Act, that the applicant meets the criteria for accreditation."
    },
