      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.108",
      "values:originalText": "(b) where a sector Schedule sets out criteria for streamlined accreditation in\nrelation to the relevant designated sector―meets those criteria.",
      "skos:definition": "(b) where a sector Schedule sets out criteria for streamlined accreditation in\nrelation to the relevant designated sector―meets those criteria.",
