      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.109",
      "values:originalText": "An accreditation is subject to the conditions set out in Schedule 1.",
      "skos:definition": "An accreditation is subject to the conditions set out in Schedule 1.",
      "cml:asserts": [
