      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.110",
      "values:originalText": "(2) The notice must include the following:\n(a) if a condition is imposed or varied:\n(i) the condition or the condition as varied;\n(ii) if applicable—the applicant’s rights to have the decision reviewed by\nthe Administrative Appeals Tribunal; and\n(b) if a condition is removed—that fact.\nSubdivision 5.2.3—Obligations of accredited person",
      "skos:definition": "(2) The notice must include the following:\n(a) if a condition is imposed or varied:\n(i) the condition or the condition as varied;\n(ii) if applicable—the applicant’s rights to have the decision reviewed by\nthe Administrative Appeals Tribunal; and\n(b) if a condition is removed—that fact.\nSubdivision 5.2.3—Obligations of accredited person",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-17"
      },
