          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-17-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "62a4925991cc1e3a185701147b85c3e4a35ff15a1f01cfff4cee0fddd2f8fc68",
      "skos:note": "Notification requirements for accredited persons",
      "dc:description": "Notice including conditions and review rights"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-5-17-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5(2) 11  Notification to accredited person relating to conditions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 110,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The notice must include the following:\n(a) if a condition is imposed or varied:\n(i) the condition or the condition as varied;\n(ii) if applicable—the applicant’s rights to have the decision reviewed by\nthe Administrative Appeals Tribunal; and\n(b) if a condition is removed—that fact.\nSubdivision 5.2.3—Obligations of accredited person"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-17-ss-2-norm",
