      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.111",
      "values:originalText": "An accredited person must comply with the conditions of their accreditation.\nNote 1:\nThis rule applies to the default conditions set out in Schedule 1 and any conditions\nimposed or varied under rule 5.10.\nNote 2:\nThis rule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).",
      "skos:definition": "An accredited person must comply with the conditions of their accreditation.\nNote 1:\nThis rule applies to the default conditions set out in Schedule 1 and any conditions\nimposed or varied under rule 5.10.\nNote 2:\nThis rule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).",
