      "skos:note": "Must comply with conditions of accreditation"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-5-19",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5 13  Accredited person must comply with conditions",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 111,
      "values:originalText": "An accredited person must comply with the conditions of their accreditation.\nNote 1:\nThis rule applies to the default conditions set out in Schedule 1 and any conditions\nimposed or varied under rule 5.10.\nNote 2:\nThis rule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)."
    },
