    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-25",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5 19  Suspension of accreditation—duration",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-5-25"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.115",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Without limitation, the CDR Accreditor, under rule 5.17:\n(a) may suspend an accreditation:\n(i) for a period of time that ends at a specified date; or\n(ii) for a period of time that ends with the occurrence of a specified event;\nand\n(b) may, subject to the same conditions on which an accreditation was\nsuspended, extend the suspension.\n(2) The CDR Accreditor may, in writing, at any time, remove a suspension.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Without limitation, the CDR Accreditor, under rule 5.17:\n(a) may suspend an accreditation:\n(i) for a period of time that ends at a specified date; or\n(ii) for a period of time that ends with the occurrence of a specified event;\nand\n(b) may, subject to the same conditions on which an accreditation was\nsuspended, extend the suspension.\n(2) The CDR Accreditor may, in writing, at any time, remove a suspension.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-25-ss-1"
        },
        {
