      "skos:definition": "(2) Before suspending an accreditation under rule 5.17, or extending a suspension,\nthe CDR Accreditor must:\n(a) inform the accredited person of:\n(i) the proposed suspension or extension (including the proposed\nduration); and\n(ii) in the case of a suspension—when it is proposed to take effect; and\n(b) give the accredited person a reasonable opportunity to be heard in relation\nto the proposed suspension or extension.",
