      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.116",
      "values:originalText": "(3) However, as soon as practicable after suspending the accreditation or extending\nthe suspension, the Accreditor must:\n(a) inform the accredited person of the suspension or extension; and\n(b) give the accredited person a reasonable opportunity to be heard in relation\nto whether the suspension should be removed.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) However, as soon as practicable after suspending the accreditation or extending\nthe suspension, the Accreditor must:\n(a) inform the accredited person of the suspension or extension; and\n(b) give the accredited person a reasonable opportunity to be heard in relation\nto whether the suspension should be removed.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-27"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-27-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-27-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a64eee1ed45a6c43ca3cb78cd469907f69ff68aa61f9354f2f907c97575e1030",
      "skos:note": "Inform accredited person of suspension or extension and provide opportunity to be heard.",
      "dc:description": "Reasonable opportunity to be heard"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-5-27-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5(3) 21  Process for urgent suspensions or extensions",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 116,
      "values:originalText": "(3) However, as soon as practicable after suspending the accreditation or extending\nthe suspension, the Accreditor must:\n(a) inform the accredited person of the suspension or extension; and\n(b) give the accredited person a reasonable opportunity to be heard in relation\nto whether the suspension should be removed."
    },
