    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-31-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5(5) 25  Other information to be kept in association with Register of Accredited",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-5-31-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.118",
      "values:originalText": "(5) The data holder or accredited person, as appropriate, must inform the\nAccreditation Registrar of the amendment that should be made to the database in\nthe form approved by the Registrar for the purposes of this subrule and as soon\nas practicable after the data holder or accredited person becomes aware of either\nof the matters mentioned in paragraph (4)(b).\nCivil penalty:",
      "skos:definition": "(5) The data holder or accredited person, as appropriate, must inform the\nAccreditation Registrar of the amendment that should be made to the database in\nthe form approved by the Registrar for the purposes of this subrule and as soon\nas practicable after the data holder or accredited person becomes aware of either\nof the matters mentioned in paragraph (4)(b).\nCivil penalty:",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-31"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
