          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-31-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-31-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5de41fd8ab295c0a19a90d975b3b1113e8b42f7355e5f805e067c5806a309a5d",
      "skos:note": "Inform Accreditation Registrar of amendment to database",
      "dc:description": "as soon as practicable after becoming aware"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-5-31-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5(5) 25  Other information to be kept in association with Register of Accredited",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 118,
      "values:originalText": "(5) The data holder or accredited person, as appropriate, must inform the\nAccreditation Registrar of the amendment that should be made to the database in\nthe form approved by the Registrar for the purposes of this subrule and as soon\nas practicable after the data holder or accredited person becomes aware of either\nof the matters mentioned in paragraph (4)(b).\nCivil penalty:"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-31-ss-5-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-31-ss-5"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-31-ss-5-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Obligation to inform Accreditation Registrar",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-32",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "5 26  Amendment and correction of entries in Register of Accredited Persons and",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-5-32"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.120",
      "values:originalText": "database\nThe Accreditation Registrar:\n(a) must, as soon as practicable after receiving information from the CDR\nAccreditor that must be entered on the Register, enter that information on\nthe Register; and\n(b) must, as soon as practicable after receiving information from the Data\nRecipient Accreditor that requires the Registrar to update information on\nthe Register, update the Register; and\n(c) may, to the extent the Accreditation Registrar considers necessary, amend\nthe database referred to in subrule 5.25(1) to reflect any amendment the\nRegistrar has been informed of in accordance with rule 5.25; and\n(d) may make clerical amendments to entries in the Register or database as\nappropriate to ensure the accuracy of the Register or database.",
      "skos:definition": "database\nThe Accreditation Registrar:\n(a) must, as soon as practicable after receiving information from the CDR\nAccreditor that must be entered on the Register, enter that information on\nthe Register; and\n(b) must, as soon as practicable after receiving information from the Data\nRecipient Accreditor that requires the Registrar to update information on\nthe Register, update the Register; and\n(c) may, to the extent the Accreditation Registrar considers necessary, amend\nthe database referred to in subrule 5.25(1) to reflect any amendment the\nRegistrar has been informed of in accordance with rule 5.25; and\n(d) may make clerical amendments to entries in the Register or database as\nappropriate to ensure the accuracy of the Register or database.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-32-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-32-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-32-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-32-logic-deontic-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-32-logic-deontic-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "46da711600098df72a70398b9945c91db3f5509b351ce8f3baa4fd3758809b85",
      "skos:note": "Must update Register upon receiving information from CDR and Data Recipient Accreditor."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-5-32",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5 26  Amendment and correction of entries in Register of Accredited Persons and",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 120,
      "values:originalText": "database\nThe Accreditation Registrar:\n(a) must, as soon as practicable after receiving information from the CDR\nAccreditor that must be entered on the Register, enter that information on\nthe Register; and\n(b) must, as soon as practicable after receiving information from the Data\nRecipient Accreditor that requires the Registrar to update information on\nthe Register, update the Register; and\n(c) may, to the extent the Accreditation Registrar considers necessary, amend\nthe database referred to in subrule 5.25(1) to reflect any amendment the\nRegistrar has been informed of in accordance with rule 5.25; and\n(d) may make clerical amendments to entries in the Register or database as\nappropriate to ensure the accuracy of the Register or database."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-32-norm",
