      "cml:premiseText": "Accredited person must not make a consumer data request.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "contrary to a direction it has received under this rule."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-40-ss-4-logic-deontic-2",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Must Not",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition of disclosing CDR data in response to consumer data request contrary to direction.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "a data holder must not disclose CDR data.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "in response to a consumer data request contrary to a direction it has received under this rule."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-5-40-ss-4-logic-deontic-3",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "Must Not",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Prohibition of individual and body corporate actions.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Civil penalty: for an individual―$50,000; and for a body corporate―$250,000.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "for an individual or a body corporate making a consumer data request contrary to a direction it has received under this rule."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-6-2",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6 1  Requirement for data holders—internal dispute resolution",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-6-2"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.123",
      "values:originalText": "A data holder in relation to a particular designated sector must meet the internal\ndispute resolution requirements in relation to that sector.\nNote 1:\nSee rule 1.7 for the meaning of “meets the internal dispute resolution requirements”.\nSee also:\n•\nfor the banking sector and non-bank lenders sector—clause 5.1 of Schedule 3;\n•\nfor the energy sector—clause 5.1 of Schedule 4.\nNote 2:\nAn accredited person must also meet those internal dispute resolution requirements: see\nparagraph 5.12(1)(b).\nNote 3:\nThis rule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).",
      "skos:definition": "A data holder in relation to a particular designated sector must meet the internal\ndispute resolution requirements in relation to that sector.\nNote 1:\nSee rule 1.7 for the meaning of “meets the internal dispute resolution requirements”.\nSee also:\n•\nfor the banking sector and non-bank lenders sector—clause 5.1 of Schedule 3;\n•\nfor the energy sector—clause 5.1 of Schedule 4.\nNote 2:\nAn accredited person must also meet those internal dispute resolution requirements: see\nparagraph 5.12(1)(b).\nNote 3:\nThis rule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-6-2-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-6-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "84b389e845bb88862483d43a95c4d8a040d70ceb92ae80e1f0ffbbe68069f724",
      "skos:note": "A data holder must meet the internal dispute resolution requirements."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-6-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 1  Requirement for data holders—internal dispute resolution",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 123,
      "values:originalText": "A data holder in relation to a particular designated sector must meet the internal\ndispute resolution requirements in relation to that sector.\nNote 1:\nSee rule 1.7 for the meaning of “meets the internal dispute resolution requirements”.\nSee also:\n•\nfor the banking sector and non-bank lenders sector—clause 5.1 of Schedule 3;\n•\nfor the energy sector—clause 5.1 of Schedule 4.\nNote 2:\nAn accredited person must also meet those internal dispute resolution requirements: see\nparagraph 5.12(1)(b).\nNote 3:\nThis rule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)."
    },
    {
