    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-3-ss-3",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7(3) 2  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 1—open and transparent management of",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-7-3-ss-3"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.125",
      "values:originalText": "(3) In addition to the information referred to in subsection 56ED(4) of the Act, the\ndata holder’s CDR policy must indicate:\n(a) whether it accepts requests for:\n(i) voluntary product data; or\n(ii) voluntary consumer data; and\n(b) if so:\n(i) whether it charges fees for disclosure of such data; and\n(ii) if it does―how information about those fees can be obtained.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) In addition to the information referred to in subsection 56ED(4) of the Act, the\ndata holder’s CDR policy must indicate:\n(a) whether it accepts requests for:\n(i) voluntary product data; or\n(ii) voluntary consumer data; and\n(b) if so:\n(i) whether it charges fees for disclosure of such data; and\n(ii) if it does―how information about those fees can be obtained.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-3"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-3-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-3-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2358cd8eb8ced7d80048ab9d338d812dbc5651d7d2a4d00b54a5f47a4389ba25",
      "skos:note": "Data holder must indicate acceptance of requests for voluntary product data and consumer data, including fees.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-7-3-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7(3) 2  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 1—open and transparent management of",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 125,
      "values:originalText": "(3) In addition to the information referred to in subsection 56ED(4) of the Act, the\ndata holder’s CDR policy must indicate:\n(a) whether it accepts requests for:\n(i) voluntary product data; or\n(ii) voluntary consumer data; and\n(b) if so:\n(i) whether it charges fees for disclosure of such data; and\n(ii) if it does―how information about those fees can be obtained."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-3-ss-3-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-3-ss-3"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
