      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: Agent"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-3-ss-3-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Must provide information about data requests and fees.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-3-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7(4) 2  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 1—open and transparent management of",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-7-3-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.125",
      "values:originalText": "(4) In addition to the information referred to in subsection 56ED(5) of the Act, the\nCDR policy of an accredited person who is or who may become an accredited\ndata recipient of CDR data must include the following:\n(a) a statement indicating the consequences to the CDR consumer if they\nwithdraw a consent to collect and use CDR data;\n(b) a list of any other accredited persons with whom the accredited person has\na sponsorship arrangement;\n(c) for each such arrangement—the nature of the services one party provides to\nthe other party;\n(d) a list of the CDR representatives of the accredited person;\n(e) for each CDR representative—the nature of the goods and services that the\nCDR representative provides to customers using CDR data;\n(f) a list of the direct and indirect OSPs of the accredited person and of any\nCDR representative (whether based in Australia or based overseas, and\nwhether or not any is an accredited person);\n(g) for each such service provider:\n(i) the nature of the services it provides;\n(ii) the CDR data or classes of CDR data that may be disclosed to it or\ncollected by it;\n(h) if the accredited person wishes to undertake general research using the\nCDR data:\n(i) a description of the research to be conducted;",
      "skos:definition": "(4) In addition to the information referred to in subsection 56ED(5) of the Act, the\nCDR policy of an accredited person who is or who may become an accredited\ndata recipient of CDR data must include the following:\n(a) a statement indicating the consequences to the CDR consumer if they\nwithdraw a consent to collect and use CDR data;\n(b) a list of any other accredited persons with whom the accredited person has\na sponsorship arrangement;\n(c) for each such arrangement—the nature of the services one party provides to\nthe other party;\n(d) a list of the CDR representatives of the accredited person;\n(e) for each CDR representative—the nature of the goods and services that the\nCDR representative provides to customers using CDR data;\n(f) a list of the direct and indirect OSPs of the accredited person and of any\nCDR representative (whether based in Australia or based overseas, and\nwhether or not any is an accredited person);\n(g) for each such service provider:\n(i) the nature of the services it provides;\n(ii) the CDR data or classes of CDR data that may be disclosed to it or\ncollected by it;\n(h) if the accredited person wishes to undertake general research using the\nCDR data:\n(i) a description of the research to be conducted;",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-3"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-3-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-3-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "56978a5be22215fe498f0eb0d12bbae82a5b7608f2b839bdf6d7e7f0200bbae4",
      "skos:note": "Accredited persons must provide certain information about their sponsorship arrangements and services.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-7-3-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7(4) 2  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 1—open and transparent management of",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 125,
      "values:originalText": "(4) In addition to the information referred to in subsection 56ED(5) of the Act, the\nCDR policy of an accredited person who is or who may become an accredited\ndata recipient of CDR data must include the following:\n(a) a statement indicating the consequences to the CDR consumer if they\nwithdraw a consent to collect and use CDR data;\n(b) a list of any other accredited persons with whom the accredited person has\na sponsorship arrangement;\n(c) for each such arrangement—the nature of the services one party provides to\nthe other party;\n(d) a list of the CDR representatives of the accredited person;\n(e) for each CDR representative—the nature of the goods and services that the\nCDR representative provides to customers using CDR data;\n(f) a list of the direct and indirect OSPs of the accredited person and of any\nCDR representative (whether based in Australia or based overseas, and\nwhether or not any is an accredited person);\n(g) for each such service provider:\n(i) the nature of the services it provides;\n(ii) the CDR data or classes of CDR data that may be disclosed to it or\ncollected by it;\n(h) if the accredited person wishes to undertake general research using the\nCDR data:\n(i) a description of the research to be conducted;"
    },
