    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-7-5-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7(2) 3A  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 4—destruction of unsolicited data—",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 128,
      "values:originalText": "(2) For subrule (1), it is irrelevant whether the action of the CDR representative in\nrelation to the service data is in accordance with the CDR representative\narrangement."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-5-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
