    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-7-6-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7(2) 3B  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 4—destruction of unsolicited data—",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 128,
      "values:originalText": "(2) For subrule (1), it is irrelevant whether the action of the direct or indirect OSP in\nrelation to the service data is in accordance with the CDR outsourcing\narrangement.\n\n\nRules relating to privacy safeguards  Part 7\nRules relating to privacy safeguards  Division 7.2\nSection 7.4\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\nSubdivision 7.2.2—Rules relating to collecting CDR data"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-6-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
