      "skos:note": "Disclosure of CDR data to an accredited person under an AP disclosure consent is permitted until July 2021 or the day the Data Standards Chair makes the data standard."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-7-9-ss-1",
