      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.131",
      "values:originalText": "(2) Despite paragraph 7.5(1)(e), disclosure of CDR data to a trusted adviser under a\nTA disclosure consent is not a permitted use or disclosure until the earlier of the\nfollowing:\n(a) 1 February 2022;\n(b) the day the Data Standards Chair makes the data standard about the matter\nreferred to in subparagraph 8.11(1)(c)(iv).",
      "skos:definition": "(2) Despite paragraph 7.5(1)(e), disclosure of CDR data to a trusted adviser under a\nTA disclosure consent is not a permitted use or disclosure until the earlier of the\nfollowing:\n(a) 1 February 2022;\n(b) the day the Data Standards Chair makes the data standard about the matter\nreferred to in subparagraph 8.11(1)(c)(iv).",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-9"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
