        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-9-ss-2-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9cd90dafc510ac4190b3cdb7a0d12d02fa29b520e987656c03a6048b3417ddef",
      "skos:note": "Disclosure of CDR data to a trusted adviser under a TA disclosure consent is permitted until certain conditions are met."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-7-9-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7(2) 5A  Limitation to disclosures of CDR data under a disclosure consent",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 131,
      "values:originalText": "(2) Despite paragraph 7.5(1)(e), disclosure of CDR data to a trusted adviser under a\nTA disclosure consent is not a permitted use or disclosure until the earlier of the\nfollowing:\n(a) 1 February 2022;\n(b) the day the Data Standards Chair makes the data standard about the matter\nreferred to in subparagraph 8.11(1)(c)(iv)."
    },
