      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.132",
      "values:originalText": "(4) For this rule:\n(a) any use or disclosure of service data by a CDR representative is taken to\nhave been by the CDR representative principal; and\n(b) it is irrelevant whether the use or disclosure is in accordance with the CDR\nrepresentative arrangement.\n\n\nRules relating to privacy safeguards  Part 7\nRules relating to privacy safeguards  Division 7.2\nSection 7.7\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\nNote:\nSee rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR representative\narrangement.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) For this rule:\n(a) any use or disclosure of service data by a CDR representative is taken to\nhave been by the CDR representative principal; and\n(b) it is irrelevant whether the use or disclosure is in accordance with the CDR\nrepresentative arrangement.\n\n\nRules relating to privacy safeguards  Part 7\nRules relating to privacy safeguards  Division 7.2\nSection 7.7\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\nNote:\nSee rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR representative\narrangement.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-10"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-10-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-10-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "0f7502c9f328e259231d2474f32e728ccbe8868452fa49c6924f7028905f752f",
      "skos:note": "Use or disclosure of service data by CDR representative is taken to be by the CDR representative principal."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-7-10-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7(4) Section 7",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 132,
      "values:originalText": "(4) For this rule:\n(a) any use or disclosure of service data by a CDR representative is taken to\nhave been by the CDR representative principal; and\n(b) it is irrelevant whether the use or disclosure is in accordance with the CDR\nrepresentative arrangement.\n\n\nRules relating to privacy safeguards  Part 7\nRules relating to privacy safeguards  Division 7.2\nSection 7.7\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\nNote:\nSee rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR representative\narrangement."
    },
