    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-10-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7(5) Section 7",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-7-10-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.132",
      "values:originalText": "(5) For this rule:\n(a) any collection of service data by a direct or indirect OSP of an accredited\nperson is taken to have been by the accredited person; and\n(b) it is irrelevant whether the collection is in accordance with the relevant\nCDR outsourcing arrangement.\nNote:\nSee rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR outsourcing\narrangement.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) For this rule:\n(a) any collection of service data by a direct or indirect OSP of an accredited\nperson is taken to have been by the accredited person; and\n(b) it is irrelevant whether the collection is in accordance with the relevant\nCDR outsourcing arrangement.\nNote:\nSee rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR outsourcing\narrangement.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-10"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
