      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-13",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 8A  Rule relating to privacy safeguards 8 and 9—failure by CDR",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-7-13"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.133",
      "values:originalText": "representative to comply with safeguards\nPrivacy safeguard 8—overseas disclosure\n(1) A CDR representative principal breaches this subrule if its CDR representative\nfails to comply with section 56EK of the Act in relation to service data of a CDR\nconsumer as if it were an accredited data recipient of the service data.\nNote 1:\nSee rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR representative\narrangement.\nNote 2:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).",
      "skos:definition": "representative to comply with safeguards\nPrivacy safeguard 8—overseas disclosure\n(1) A CDR representative principal breaches this subrule if its CDR representative\nfails to comply with section 56EK of the Act in relation to service data of a CDR\nconsumer as if it were an accredited data recipient of the service data.\nNote 1:\nSee rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR representative\narrangement.\nNote 2:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8).",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-13-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-13-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "703c5524b545e9087db3ed1dfe1b6f58d5e276c670f27d61ffd4e64ff1256aa7",
      "skos:note": "Comply with section 56EK of the Act in relation to service data of a CDR consumer"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-7-13",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 8A  Rule relating to privacy safeguards 8 and 9—failure by CDR",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 133,
      "values:originalText": "representative to comply with safeguards\nPrivacy safeguard 8—overseas disclosure\n(1) A CDR representative principal breaches this subrule if its CDR representative\nfails to comply with section 56EK of the Act in relation to service data of a CDR\nconsumer as if it were an accredited data recipient of the service data.\nNote 1:\nSee rule 1.10AA for the definition of “service data” in relation to a CDR representative\narrangement.\nNote 2:\nThis subrule is a civil penalty provision (see rule 9.8)."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-13-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
