    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-15",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 9  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 10—notifying of the disclosure of CDR",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-7-15"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.134",
      "values:originalText": "data\n(1) For subsection 56EM(1) of the Act, a data holder that discloses CDR data to an\naccredited person as a result of a consumer data request must, as soon as\npracticable, update each consumer dashboard that relates to the request to\nindicate:\n(a) what CDR data was disclosed; and\n(b) when the CDR data was disclosed; and\n(c) the accredited data recipient, identified in accordance with any entry on the\nRegister of Accredited Persons specified as being for that purpose.\nNote 1:\nFor correction requests, see section 56EP of the Act (privacy safeguard 13) and\nSubdivision 7.2.5 of these rules.\n\n\nRules relating to privacy safeguards  Part 7\nRules relating to privacy safeguards  Division 7.2\nSection 7.10\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\nNote 2:\nIf a consumer data request is made that relates to a joint account, the other joint account\nholder’s consumer dashboard may not be required to be similarly updated. See rule",
      "skos:definition": "data\n(1) For subsection 56EM(1) of the Act, a data holder that discloses CDR data to an\naccredited person as a result of a consumer data request must, as soon as\npracticable, update each consumer dashboard that relates to the request to\nindicate:\n(a) what CDR data was disclosed; and\n(b) when the CDR data was disclosed; and\n(c) the accredited data recipient, identified in accordance with any entry on the\nRegister of Accredited Persons specified as being for that purpose.\nNote 1:\nFor correction requests, see section 56EP of the Act (privacy safeguard 13) and\nSubdivision 7.2.5 of these rules.\n\n\nRules relating to privacy safeguards  Part 7\nRules relating to privacy safeguards  Division 7.2\nSection 7.10\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\nNote 2:\nIf a consumer data request is made that relates to a joint account, the other joint account\nholder’s consumer dashboard may not be required to be similarly updated. See rule",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-15-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-15-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "19b298d6e36d8c357f050416bc5c02fe0da46f3954276674e9e6ac80459b6803",
      "skos:note": "Update consumer dashboard with disclosed CDR data and recipient information.",
      "dc:description": "yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-7-15",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 9  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 10—notifying of the disclosure of CDR",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 134,
      "values:originalText": "data\n(1) For subsection 56EM(1) of the Act, a data holder that discloses CDR data to an\naccredited person as a result of a consumer data request must, as soon as\npracticable, update each consumer dashboard that relates to the request to\nindicate:\n(a) what CDR data was disclosed; and\n(b) when the CDR data was disclosed; and\n(c) the accredited data recipient, identified in accordance with any entry on the\nRegister of Accredited Persons specified as being for that purpose.\nNote 1:\nFor correction requests, see section 56EP of the Act (privacy safeguard 13) and\nSubdivision 7.2.5 of these rules.\n\n\nRules relating to privacy safeguards  Part 7\nRules relating to privacy safeguards  Division 7.2\nSection 7.10\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\nNote 2:\nIf a consumer data request is made that relates to a joint account, the other joint account\nholder’s consumer dashboard may not be required to be similarly updated. See rule"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-15-norm",
