      "values:originalText": "(2) For this rule, where an accredited data recipient is an OSP chain principal, a\nfailure by a direct or indirect OSP to comply with Schedule 2 in relation to\nservice data is taken to be a failure by the accredited data recipient.\n\n\nRules relating to privacy safeguards  Part 7\nRules relating to privacy safeguards  Division 7.2\nSection 7.12\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For this rule, where an accredited data recipient is an OSP chain principal, a\nfailure by a direct or indirect OSP to comply with Schedule 2 in relation to\nservice data is taken to be a failure by the accredited data recipient.\n\n\nRules relating to privacy safeguards  Part 7\nRules relating to privacy safeguards  Division 7.2\nSection 7.12\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020",
      "values:partOf": {
