      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.136",
      "values:originalText": "(3) For this rule, where an accredited data recipient is a CDR representative\nprincipal, a failure by:\n(a) the CDR representative; or\n(b) any direct or indirect OSP of the CDR representative;\nto comply with Schedule 2 in relation to service data is taken to be a failure by\nthe CDR representative principal.",
      "skos:definition": "(3) For this rule, where an accredited data recipient is a CDR representative\nprincipal, a failure by:\n(a) the CDR representative; or\n(b) any direct or indirect OSP of the CDR representative;\nto comply with Schedule 2 in relation to service data is taken to be a failure by\nthe CDR representative principal.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-18"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
