        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "c45e1f451339f299a60e1f4e310a26cefb4da925b3cacdf459023f1d10a7174f",
      "skos:note": "Failure to comply with Schedule 2 is attributed to the CDR representative principal"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-7-18-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7(3) 11  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 12—security of CDR data",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 136,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For this rule, where an accredited data recipient is a CDR representative\nprincipal, a failure by:\n(a) the CDR representative; or\n(b) any direct or indirect OSP of the CDR representative;\nto comply with Schedule 2 in relation to service data is taken to be a failure by\nthe CDR representative principal."
    },
    {
