        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-19-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-19-ss-3-logic-alleninterval-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-19-ss-3-logic-ltl-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3b7956851109b2bf8780ec73e683ba1be5510d6fa58690ae05327a06f5531765",
      "skos:note": "Failure to comply with subsection 56EO(2) of the Act is taken as a failure by the CDR representative principal."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-7-19-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7(3) 12  Rule relating to privacy safeguard 12—de-identification of redundant data",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 137,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For this rule, where an accredited data recipient is a CDR representative\nprincipal, a failure by a CDR representative to comply with subsection 56EO(2)\nof the Act in relation to service data as if:\n(a) it were a CDR entity; and\n(b) the references in this rule to provisions in Division 4.3 were references to\nthe corresponding provisions in Division 4.3A;\nis taken to be a failure by the CDR representative principal."
    },
