    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-8",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8 1  Simplified outline of this Part",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-8-8"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.140",
      "values:originalText": "Product data requests and consumer data requests under these rules are made in\naccordance with data standards, which are made under Division 6 of Part IVD of\nthe Act.\nThis Part of these rules sets out rules relating to data standards.\nThe Data Standards Chair is established by the Act and is responsible for making\ndata standards. The Data Standards Chair is required to establish Data Standards\nAdvisory Committees to advise the Chair about data standards.\nThis Part also sets out procedural requirements for making, amending and\nreviewing data standards, and specifies data standards that the Data Standards\nChair is required to make. These are all binding data standards.\n\n\nRules relating to data standards  Part 8\nData Standards Advisory Committees  Division 8.2\nSection 8.2\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020",
      "skos:definition": "Product data requests and consumer data requests under these rules are made in\naccordance with data standards, which are made under Division 6 of Part IVD of\nthe Act.\nThis Part of these rules sets out rules relating to data standards.\nThe Data Standards Chair is established by the Act and is responsible for making\ndata standards. The Data Standards Chair is required to establish Data Standards\nAdvisory Committees to advise the Chair about data standards.\nThis Part also sets out procedural requirements for making, amending and\nreviewing data standards, and specifies data standards that the Data Standards\nChair is required to make. These are all binding data standards.\n\n\nRules relating to data standards  Part 8\nData Standards Advisory Committees  Division 8.2\nSection 8.2\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-8-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-8-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "7c21b63a6fd7661fd977d477c516fa17cc00db1e45ea1ede0b7af366700c3855",
      "skos:note": "Establishment of Data Standards Advisory Committees"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-8-8",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8 1  Simplified outline of this Part",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 140,
      "values:originalText": "Product data requests and consumer data requests under these rules are made in\naccordance with data standards, which are made under Division 6 of Part IVD of\nthe Act.\nThis Part of these rules sets out rules relating to data standards.\nThe Data Standards Chair is established by the Act and is responsible for making\ndata standards. The Data Standards Chair is required to establish Data Standards\nAdvisory Committees to advise the Chair about data standards.\nThis Part also sets out procedural requirements for making, amending and\nreviewing data standards, and specifies data standards that the Data Standards\nChair is required to make. These are all binding data standards.\n\n\nRules relating to data standards  Part 8\nData Standards Advisory Committees  Division 8.2\nSection 8.2\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-8-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-8"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:State"
      },
      "skos:scopeNote": "borne by: State"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-8-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "establish",
      "cml:logicSummary": "Chair must establish committees",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Chair is required to advise on data standards",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Committees must be established"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8 2  Establishment of Data Standards Advisory Committee",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-8-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.141",
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Data Standards Chair must, by written instrument, establish and maintain a\ncommittee to advise the Chair about data standards in relation to each designated\nsector (a Data Standards Advisory Committee).\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901\nand paragraph 13(1)(a) of the Legislation Act 2003.\n(2) To avoid doubt, a Data Standards Advisory Committee may be appointed to\ncover more than one designated sector.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) The Data Standards Chair must, by written instrument, establish and maintain a\ncommittee to advise the Chair about data standards in relation to each designated\nsector (a Data Standards Advisory Committee).\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901\nand paragraph 13(1)(a) of the Legislation Act 2003.\n(2) To avoid doubt, a Data Standards Advisory Committee may be appointed to\ncover more than one designated sector.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-9-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-9-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b41ae731c845412a467364b3973ff1b7860d8bef44262213c5a45fd80b1990e6"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-8-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8 2  Establishment of Data Standards Advisory Committee",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 141,
      "values:originalText": "(1) The Data Standards Chair must, by written instrument, establish and maintain a\ncommittee to advise the Chair about data standards in relation to each designated\nsector (a Data Standards Advisory Committee).\nNote:\nFor variation and revocation, see subsection 33(3) of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901\nand paragraph 13(1)(a) of the Legislation Act 2003.\n(2) To avoid doubt, a Data Standards Advisory Committee may be appointed to\ncover more than one designated sector."
    },
