    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-15",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8 8  Notification when developing or amending data standards",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-8-15"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.143",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to subrule (2), the Data Standards Chair must notify the Commission and\nthe Information Commissioner, in writing, of a proposal to make or amend a data\nstandard.\n(2) If the standard or amendment is urgent, the Chair may instead notify the\nCommission and the Information Commissioner after it has been made.\n(3) A failure to comply with this rule does not affect the validity or enforceability of\na data standard or an amendment to a data standard.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to subrule (2), the Data Standards Chair must notify the Commission and\nthe Information Commissioner, in writing, of a proposal to make or amend a data\nstandard.\n(2) If the standard or amendment is urgent, the Chair may instead notify the\nCommission and the Information Commissioner after it has been made.\n(3) A failure to comply with this rule does not affect the validity or enforceability of\na data standard or an amendment to a data standard.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-15-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-15-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-15-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "926b3d0253ce2a43b499d4d957c784e9759d84c0dda59f8f6b091c43ed1ff3e6"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-8-15",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8 8  Notification when developing or amending data standards",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 143,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to subrule (2), the Data Standards Chair must notify the Commission and\nthe Information Commissioner, in writing, of a proposal to make or amend a data\nstandard.\n(2) If the standard or amendment is urgent, the Chair may instead notify the\nCommission and the Information Commissioner after it has been made.\n(3) A failure to comply with this rule does not affect the validity or enforceability of\na data standard or an amendment to a data standard."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-15-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
