      "values:originalText": "(3) The data standards must be subject to such consumer testing as the Data\nStandards Chair considers appropriate.\n\n\nOther matters  Part 9\nPreliminary  Division 9.1\nSection 9.1\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020",
      "skos:definition": "(3) The data standards must be subject to such consumer testing as the Data\nStandards Chair considers appropriate.\n\n\nOther matters  Part 9\nPreliminary  Division 9.1\nSection 9.1\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-89"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-89-ss-3-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-89-ss-3-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "466e77e2d373c30bb1a39e7507529f547b2482a4e67db0ee6c824466cd49bc18",
      "skos:note": "Consumer testing of data standards is mandatory."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-89-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4(3) 20E(3)(g);",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 146,
      "values:originalText": "(3) The data standards must be subject to such consumer testing as the Data\nStandards Chair considers appropriate.\n\n\nOther matters  Part 9\nPreliminary  Division 9.1\nSection 9.1\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020"
    },
