      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.152",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Where a record referred to in this rule is kept in a language other than English, an\nEnglish translation of the record must be made available within a reasonable time\nto a person who:\n(a) is entitled to inspect the records under Subdivision 9.3.2; and\n(b) asks for the English translation.\n\n\nOther matters  Part 9\nReporting, record keeping and audit  Division 9.3\nSection 9.4\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\nPeriod for retention of records",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Where a record referred to in this rule is kept in a language other than English, an\nEnglish translation of the record must be made available within a reasonable time\nto a person who:\n(a) is entitled to inspect the records under Subdivision 9.3.2; and\n(b) asks for the English translation.\n\n\nOther matters  Part 9\nReporting, record keeping and audit  Division 9.3\nSection 9.4\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\nPeriod for retention of records",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-91"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
