      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.157",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A person who receives a request under this rule must provide the requested\ncopies, in the form (if any) approved by the Commission for the purposes of this\nrule, as soon as practicable, but no later than 10 business days, after receiving the\nrequest.\nCivil penalty:\n(a) for an individual―$50,000; and\n(b) for a body corporate―$250,000.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A person who receives a request under this rule must provide the requested\ncopies, in the form (if any) approved by the Commission for the purposes of this\nrule, as soon as practicable, but no later than 10 business days, after receiving the\nrequest.\nCivil penalty:\n(a) for an individual―$50,000; and\n(b) for a body corporate―$250,000.",
      "values:partOf": {
