      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.157",
      "values:originalText": "(6) An accredited data recipient must not charge a fee for making or responding to a\nrequest under subrule (2).\nCivil penalty:\n(a) for an individual―$50,000; and\n(b) for a body corporate―$250,000.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) An accredited data recipient must not charge a fee for making or responding to a\nrequest under subrule (2).\nCivil penalty:\n(a) for an individual―$50,000; and\n(b) for a body corporate―$250,000.",
