        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-9-11-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "8cc1f3691196a63cee2e018c844e657e92aff4b3f00e9906faf7206797eeeeee",
      "skos:note": "The Information Commissioner may audit compliance with privacy safeguards."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-9-11-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9(2) 6  Audits by the Commission and the Information Commissioner",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 158,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The Information Commissioner may, at any time, audit the compliance of any\nCDR participant with any or all of the following:\n(a) the privacy safeguards (Division 5 of Part IVD of the Act);\n(b) these rules to the extent that they relate to:\n(i) the privacy safeguards (see in particular Part 7 of these rules); or\n(ii) the privacy and confidentiality of CDR data."
    },
