        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "3a61c12e4397c38a0296a92e25e66ebbd5bd297a187d6ca467f3ac3287311687",
      "skos:note": "Request for production of records or information",
      "dc:description": "true"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-9-11-ss-3",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9(3) 6  Audits by the Commission and the Information Commissioner",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 158,
      "values:originalText": "(3) For the purposes of conducting an audit or otherwise monitoring the compliance\nof the CDR participant with the provisions mentioned in subrules (1) and (2), the\nCommission, or the Information Commissioner, may give a CDR participant a\nwritten notice that requests the CDR participant to produce, within the time\nspecified in the notice:\n(a) copies of records that are required by this Division to be kept; or\n(b) information from such records."
    },
