      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.159",
      "values:originalText": "For section 56BL of the Act, the provisions of these rules listed in the following\ntable are civil penalty provisions (within the meaning of the Regulatory Powers\nAct):\nItem\nCivil penalty provision\nsubrule 1.10A(4)\nsubrule 1.10A(12)\nsubrule 1.10A(14)\nsubrule 1.12(1)\nsubrule 1.13(1)\nsubrule 1.14(1)\nsubrule 1.15(1)\nsubrule 1.15(5)\nsubrule 1.15(7)\nsubrule 1.16(2)\nsubrule 1.16(4)\nsubrule 1.16A(2)\nsubrule 1.16A(4)\nsubrule 1.20(2)\nsubrule 1.22(3)\nsubrule 1.22(4)\nsubrule 1.22(5)\nsubrule 1.23(4)\nsubrule 1.23(5)\nsubrule 1.23(6)\nrule 1.25\nsubrule 2.4(2A)\nsubrule 2.4(3)\nrule 2.6\nsubrule 3.4(3)\nsubrule 4.3(5)\nsubrule 4.4(3)\nsubrule 4.5(2)\nsubrule 4.5(3)\nsubrule 4.6(3)\nsubrule 4.6(4)\nsubrule 4.7B(3)\nsubrule 4.13(2)\nrule 4.18",
      "skos:definition": "For section 56BL of the Act, the provisions of these rules listed in the following\ntable are civil penalty provisions (within the meaning of the Regulatory Powers\nAct):\nItem\nCivil penalty provision\nsubrule 1.10A(4)\nsubrule 1.10A(12)\nsubrule 1.10A(14)\nsubrule 1.12(1)\nsubrule 1.13(1)\nsubrule 1.14(1)\nsubrule 1.15(1)\nsubrule 1.15(5)\nsubrule 1.15(7)\nsubrule 1.16(2)\nsubrule 1.16(4)\nsubrule 1.16A(2)\nsubrule 1.16A(4)\nsubrule 1.20(2)\nsubrule 1.22(3)\nsubrule 1.22(4)\nsubrule 1.22(5)\nsubrule 1.23(4)\nsubrule 1.23(5)\nsubrule 1.23(6)\nrule 1.25\nsubrule 2.4(2A)\nsubrule 2.4(3)\nrule 2.6\nsubrule 3.4(3)\nsubrule 4.3(5)\nsubrule 4.4(3)\nsubrule 4.5(2)\nsubrule 4.5(3)\nsubrule 4.6(3)\nsubrule 4.6(4)\nsubrule 4.7B(3)\nsubrule 4.13(2)\nrule 4.18",
      "cml:asserts": [
