      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.163",
      "values:originalText": "The amendments of clause 7.2 of Schedule 3 to the principal rules made by the\namending rules do not apply to an accredited person in relation to CDR data, and\nany CDR data directly or indirectly derived from that data, if the person started\nto hold such data before the commencement of those amendments.\n\nSchedule 1  Default conditions on accreditations",
      "skos:definition": "The amendments of clause 7.2 of Schedule 3 to the principal rules made by the\namending rules do not apply to an accredited person in relation to CDR data, and\nany CDR data directly or indirectly derived from that data, if the person started\nto hold such data before the commencement of those amendments.\n\nSchedule 1  Default conditions on accreditations",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-508-norm"
        },
        {
