        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "40c0edaffd6733ee714c5456e9eff60abadaab83ef017dd78f8dd3b7097bf848",
      "skos:note": "Accredited person must provide attestation statement within 3 months after end of reporting period.",
      "dc:description": "True"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-1-sec-2-3-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "2(2) 1  Ongoing reporting obligation on accredited persons without streamlined",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 165,
      "values:originalText": "(2) The accredited person must provide an attestation statement to the CDR\nAccreditor within 3 months after the end of:\n(a) the first reporting period; and\n(b) every second reporting period thereafter;\nthat covers the reporting period.\n\nSchedule 1  Default conditions on accreditations"
    },
    {
