    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-2-sec-1-11",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1 4  Step 2—Define the boundaries of the CDR data environment",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 168,
      "values:originalText": "(1) An accredited data recipient must assess, define and document the boundaries of\nits CDR data environment.\n(2) The accredited data recipient must review the boundaries of its CDR data\nenvironment for completeness and accuracy:\n(a) as soon as practicable when it becomes aware of material changes to the\nextent and nature of threats to its CDR data environment; or\n(b) where no such material changes occur—at least annually."
    },
