        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "55454f8984a883e543a03d65d77b6feb04855b21fb819885ef1b1d45ff2db765",
      "skos:note": "Review testing program annually or upon material change"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-2-sec-1-13-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1(5) 6  Step 4—Implement a formal controls assessment program",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 168,
      "values:originalText": "(5) The accredited data recipient must review the sufficiency of its testing program\nreferred to in subclause (1):\n(a) when there is a material change to the nature and extent of threats to its\nCDR data environment or to the boundaries of its CDR data environment—\nas soon as practicable; or\n(b) where no such material changes occur—at least annually."
    },
