        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-1-10-ss-2-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "b41fc60adc1c53f08deda4c7000177c97f3dd64bb843147585cf7f10283ae4da",
      "skos:note": "Details of authorisations for direct debit deductions must be provided.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-1-10-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "1(2) 3  Meaning of customer data, account data, transaction data and product specific",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 180,
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the purposes of subparagraph (b)(iv) of column 2 of item 2, details of\nauthorisations for direct debit deductions include, to the extent available:\n(a) any identifier for the counter-party that is authorised to debit the account;\nand\n(b) the dates and amounts of any debits the counter-party has made."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-1-10-ss-2-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
