      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.190",
      "values:originalText": "(4) A relevant non-bank lender also meets the large provider qualification on a day\nthat is, or is after, the commencement day, if the lender is an accredited person\non that day.",
      "skos:definition": "(4) A relevant non-bank lender also meets the large provider qualification on a day\nthat is, or is after, the commencement day, if the lender is an accredited person\non that day.",
      "values:partOf": {
