      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.190",
      "values:originalText": "(5) However, a relevant non-bank lender to whom subclause (4) applies is taken, for\nthe purposes of that subclause, to cease to meet the large provider qualification\non and after a later day if the lender:\n(a) ceases to be an accredited person on that later day; and\n(b) has not met the large provider qualification in subclause (3) at any time\nbefore that later day.\nCalculating averaged value of resident loans and resident finance leases",
      "skos:definition": "(5) However, a relevant non-bank lender to whom subclause (4) applies is taken, for\nthe purposes of that subclause, to cease to meet the large provider qualification\non and after a later day if the lender:\n(a) ceases to be an accredited person on that later day; and\n(b) has not met the large provider qualification in subclause (3) at any time\nbefore that later day.\nCalculating averaged value of resident loans and resident finance leases",
      "values:partOf": {
