      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.190",
      "values:originalText": "(6) For the purpose of calculating the averaged value of resident loans and resident\nfinance leases reported by a relevant non-bank lender and each of its associated\nnon-bank lenders over 12 calendar months, any month in relation to which no\nreport was made by the lender, or any of its associated non-bank lenders, is to be\ndisregarded.\nNote:\nA lender is not required to provide a monthly report to the Australian Prudential\nRegulation Authority under the applicable standards if its total assets are less than $400\nmillion as at the last day of its financial year.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) For the purpose of calculating the averaged value of resident loans and resident\nfinance leases reported by a relevant non-bank lender and each of its associated\nnon-bank lenders over 12 calendar months, any month in relation to which no\nreport was made by the lender, or any of its associated non-bank lenders, is to be\ndisregarded.\nNote:\nA lender is not required to provide a monthly report to the Australian Prudential\nRegulation Authority under the applicable standards if its total assets are less than $400\nmillion as at the last day of its financial year.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-14"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-14-ss-6-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-14-ss-6-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-14-ss-6-logic-alleninterval-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "713494a53a7419a2dd32a6ae13646e97f98045b4d2f24ccd78c3c749fbe478b9",
      "skos:note": "Disregard months with no report for averaging resident loans and finance leases."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-6-14-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6(6) 2  Meaning of initial provider and large provider",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 190,
      "values:originalText": "(6) For the purpose of calculating the averaged value of resident loans and resident\nfinance leases reported by a relevant non-bank lender and each of its associated\nnon-bank lenders over 12 calendar months, any month in relation to which no\nreport was made by the lender, or any of its associated non-bank lenders, is to be\ndisregarded.\nNote:\nA lender is not required to provide a monthly report to the Australian Prudential\nRegulation Authority under the applicable standards if its total assets are less than $400\nmillion as at the last day of its financial year."
    },
