    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-15",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6 3  Obligation to notify Commission about customer numbers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-6-15"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.192",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A relevant non-bank lender that satisfies paragraph 6.2(3)(a) must, if requested\nby the Commission, notify the Commission of the following, in writing, as soon\nas practicable after receiving the request:\n(a) the total value of the resident loans and resident finance leases mentioned\nin subparagraphs 6.2(3)(a)(i) and (ii);\n(b) whether the lender also satisfies paragraph 6.2(3)(b).\nCivil penalty:\n$250,000.\n(2) A relevant non-bank lender must notify the Commission in writing as soon as\npracticable if, on a day mentioned in subclause 6.2(3), it satisfies paragraph",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A relevant non-bank lender that satisfies paragraph 6.2(3)(a) must, if requested\nby the Commission, notify the Commission of the following, in writing, as soon\nas practicable after receiving the request:\n(a) the total value of the resident loans and resident finance leases mentioned\nin subparagraphs 6.2(3)(a)(i) and (ii);\n(b) whether the lender also satisfies paragraph 6.2(3)(b).\nCivil penalty:\n$250,000.\n(2) A relevant non-bank lender must notify the Commission in writing as soon as\npracticable if, on a day mentioned in subclause 6.2(3), it satisfies paragraph",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-15-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-15-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "64268a2083b07e1aee409e092c8f6a48e0989bd3106e326e864de57f4338cf66"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-6-15",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 3  Obligation to notify Commission about customer numbers",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 192,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A relevant non-bank lender that satisfies paragraph 6.2(3)(a) must, if requested\nby the Commission, notify the Commission of the following, in writing, as soon\nas practicable after receiving the request:\n(a) the total value of the resident loans and resident finance leases mentioned\nin subparagraphs 6.2(3)(a)(i) and (ii);\n(b) whether the lender also satisfies paragraph 6.2(3)(b).\nCivil penalty:\n$250,000.\n(2) A relevant non-bank lender must notify the Commission in writing as soon as\npracticable if, on a day mentioned in subclause 6.2(3), it satisfies paragraph"
    },
