    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-6-17",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 4  Application to initial providers",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 192,
      "values:originalText": "(1) These rules apply, as set out in the following table, in relation to a relevant\nnon-bank lender that is an initial provider.\n\nProvisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors  Schedule 3\nApplication of these rules to the banking and NBL sectors  Part 6\nClause 6.5\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\nApplication to initial providers\nColumn 1\nType of request\nColumn 2\nApplication of rules\nA product data request under\nPart 2 of these rules\nOn and after the tranche 1 date\nA consumer data request\nunder Part 4 of these rules,\nother than a complex request\nOn and after the tranche 2 date\n(2) These rules do not apply to a complex request under Part 4, in relation to a\nrelevant non-bank lender that is an initial provider."
    },
