    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-18",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6 5  Application to large providers",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-6-18"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.193",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this clause, where a relevant non-bank lender is a large provider, its LP date is\nthe date that it became a large provider.\n(2) These rules apply in relation to such a large provider with an LP date that is on or\nbefore 13 July 2025 as set out in the following table.\nApplication to large providers with LP date on or before 13 July 2025\nColumn 1\nType of request\nColumn 2\nApplication of rules\nA product data request under\nPart 2 of these rules\nOn and after the tranche 1 date\nA consumer data request\nunder Part 4 of these rules,\nother than a complex request\nOn and after the tranche 3 date\n(3) These rules apply in relation to such a large provider with an LP date that is after\n13 July 2025 date as set out in the following table.\nApplication to large providers with LP date after 13 July 2025\nColumn 1\nType of request\nColumn 2\nApplication of rules\nA product data request under\nPart 2 of these rules\nOn and after the day 12 months after its LP\ndate\nA consumer data request\nunder Part 4 of these rules,\nother than a complex request\nOn and after the day 15 months after its LP\ndate\n\n(4) These rules do not apply to a complex request under Part 4, in relation to a\nrelevant non-bank lender that is a large provider.\n\nSchedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In this clause, where a relevant non-bank lender is a large provider, its LP date is\nthe date that it became a large provider.\n(2) These rules apply in relation to such a large provider with an LP date that is on or\nbefore 13 July 2025 as set out in the following table.\nApplication to large providers with LP date on or before 13 July 2025\nColumn 1\nType of request\nColumn 2\nApplication of rules\nA product data request under\nPart 2 of these rules\nOn and after the tranche 1 date\nA consumer data request\nunder Part 4 of these rules,\nother than a complex request\nOn and after the tranche 3 date\n(3) These rules apply in relation to such a large provider with an LP date that is after\n13 July 2025 date as set out in the following table.\nApplication to large providers with LP date after 13 July 2025\nColumn 1\nType of request\nColumn 2\nApplication of rules\nA product data request under\nPart 2 of these rules\nOn and after the day 12 months after its LP\ndate\nA consumer data request\nunder Part 4 of these rules,\nother than a complex request\nOn and after the day 15 months after its LP\ndate\n\n(4) These rules do not apply to a complex request under Part 4, in relation to a\nrelevant non-bank lender that is a large provider.\n\nSchedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-18-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-18-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-18-ss-3"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-18-ss-4"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "ca7aefc43c916c9243884b549ecc5cfc4af9dbf633581fe2565e346ab61adcae"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-6-18",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 5  Application to large providers",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 193,
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this clause, where a relevant non-bank lender is a large provider, its LP date is\nthe date that it became a large provider.\n(2) These rules apply in relation to such a large provider with an LP date that is on or\nbefore 13 July 2025 as set out in the following table.\nApplication to large providers with LP date on or before 13 July 2025\nColumn 1\nType of request\nColumn 2\nApplication of rules\nA product data request under\nPart 2 of these rules\nOn and after the tranche 1 date\nA consumer data request\nunder Part 4 of these rules,\nother than a complex request\nOn and after the tranche 3 date\n(3) These rules apply in relation to such a large provider with an LP date that is after\n13 July 2025 date as set out in the following table.\nApplication to large providers with LP date after 13 July 2025\nColumn 1\nType of request\nColumn 2\nApplication of rules\nA product data request under\nPart 2 of these rules\nOn and after the day 12 months after its LP\ndate\nA consumer data request\nunder Part 4 of these rules,\nother than a complex request\nOn and after the day 15 months after its LP\ndate\n\n(4) These rules do not apply to a complex request under Part 4, in relation to a\nrelevant non-bank lender that is a large provider.\n\nSchedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-18-ss-1",
