      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.193",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this clause, where a relevant non-bank lender is a large provider, its LP date is\nthe date that it became a large provider.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In this clause, where a relevant non-bank lender is a large provider, its LP date is\nthe date that it became a large provider.",
      "values:partOf": {
