      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.193",
      "values:originalText": "(4) These rules do not apply to a complex request under Part 4, in relation to a\nrelevant non-bank lender that is a large provider.\n\nSchedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors",
      "skos:definition": "(4) These rules do not apply to a complex request under Part 4, in relation to a\nrelevant non-bank lender that is a large provider.\n\nSchedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors",
      "values:partOf": {
