      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.194",
      "values:originalText": "Part 3 of these rules does not apply in relation to NBL sector data.\n\nProvisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors  Schedule 3\nApplication of these rules to the banking and NBL sectors  Part 6\nClause 6.8\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020",
      "skos:definition": "Part 3 of these rules does not apply in relation to NBL sector data.\n\nProvisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors  Schedule 3\nApplication of these rules to the banking and NBL sectors  Part 6\nClause 6.8\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-20-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-20-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9d80e69798eb0138c6c8385c1d7916d298b3af51c2f6c6ddcef9b009648a5642",
      "skos:note": "Part 3 of these rules does not apply in relation to NBL sector data."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-6-20",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 7  Consumer data requests under Part 3 of these rules",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 194,
      "values:originalText": "Part 3 of these rules does not apply in relation to NBL sector data.\n\nProvisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors  Schedule 3\nApplication of these rules to the banking and NBL sectors  Part 6\nClause 6.8\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020"
    },
