    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-22",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6 9  Entities that become unrestricted ADIs after specified date",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-6-22"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.195",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This clause applies to a person who becomes an unrestricted ADI on a day (the\nrelevant day) that is on or after the day the Competition and Consumer\n(Consumer Data Right) Amendment Rules (2025 Measures No. 1) 2025\ncommences.\nNote:\nThis includes a person who was previously a restricted ADI, and was therefore an\nexcluded data holder for this sector.\n(2) These rules apply in relation to the person:\n(a) in respect of a product data request—on and after the day that is 12 months\nafter the relevant day; and\n(b) in respect of a consumer data request made by an accredited person, other\nthan a complex request—on and after the day that is 15 months after the\nrelevant day; and\n(c) in respect of a complex request made by an accredited person—on and\nafter the day that is 18 months after the relevant day.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This clause applies to a person who becomes an unrestricted ADI on a day (the\nrelevant day) that is on or after the day the Competition and Consumer\n(Consumer Data Right) Amendment Rules (2025 Measures No. 1) 2025\ncommences.\nNote:\nThis includes a person who was previously a restricted ADI, and was therefore an\nexcluded data holder for this sector.\n(2) These rules apply in relation to the person:\n(a) in respect of a product data request—on and after the day that is 12 months\nafter the relevant day; and\n(b) in respect of a consumer data request made by an accredited person, other\nthan a complex request—on and after the day that is 15 months after the\nrelevant day; and\n(c) in respect of a complex request made by an accredited person—on and\nafter the day that is 18 months after the relevant day.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-22-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-22-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "166a6cf2e522d5f4a5920c6c6252adcd3916b74c7f59773eea8bc1fe831a6e82"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-6-22",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 9  Entities that become unrestricted ADIs after specified date",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 195,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This clause applies to a person who becomes an unrestricted ADI on a day (the\nrelevant day) that is on or after the day the Competition and Consumer\n(Consumer Data Right) Amendment Rules (2025 Measures No. 1) 2025\ncommences.\nNote:\nThis includes a person who was previously a restricted ADI, and was therefore an\nexcluded data holder for this sector.\n(2) These rules apply in relation to the person:\n(a) in respect of a product data request—on and after the day that is 12 months\nafter the relevant day; and\n(b) in respect of a consumer data request made by an accredited person, other\nthan a complex request—on and after the day that is 15 months after the\nrelevant day; and\n(c) in respect of a complex request made by an accredited person—on and\nafter the day that is 18 months after the relevant day."
    },
