    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-23",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6 10  Providers of buy now, pay later products",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-6-23"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.195",
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this clause, where a data holder in the banking sector offers a covered product\nthat is a buy now, pay later product (a BNPL product), its BNPL date is the date\nthat it first offered a BNPL product.\n(2) These rules apply in relation to such a data holder with a BNPL date that is on or\nbefore the tranche 1 date, in respect of CDR data that relates to a BNPL product,\nas set out in the following table:\nApplication to data holder with BNPL date on or before the tranche 1 date,\nin respect of CDR data that relates to a BNPL product\nColumn 1\nType of request\nColumn 2\nApplication of rules\nA product data request under\nPart 2 of these rules\nOn and after the tranche 1 date\nA consumer data request\nunder Part 4 of these rules,\nother than a complex request\nOn and after the tranche 2 date\n(3) These rules apply in relation to such a data holder with a BNPL date that is\nbetween 14 July 2026 and 10 May 2027, in respect of CDR data that relates to a\nBNPL product, as set out in the following table:\n\nSchedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors",
      "skos:definition": "(1) In this clause, where a data holder in the banking sector offers a covered product\nthat is a buy now, pay later product (a BNPL product), its BNPL date is the date\nthat it first offered a BNPL product.\n(2) These rules apply in relation to such a data holder with a BNPL date that is on or\nbefore the tranche 1 date, in respect of CDR data that relates to a BNPL product,\nas set out in the following table:\nApplication to data holder with BNPL date on or before the tranche 1 date,\nin respect of CDR data that relates to a BNPL product\nColumn 1\nType of request\nColumn 2\nApplication of rules\nA product data request under\nPart 2 of these rules\nOn and after the tranche 1 date\nA consumer data request\nunder Part 4 of these rules,\nother than a complex request\nOn and after the tranche 2 date\n(3) These rules apply in relation to such a data holder with a BNPL date that is\nbetween 14 July 2026 and 10 May 2027, in respect of CDR data that relates to a\nBNPL product, as set out in the following table:\n\nSchedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-23-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-23-ss-2"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-23-ss-3"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "e360677c690d4991abe00f6174b6c4a3b5931501b002aa95b617c78b7f0bd64f"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-6-23",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 10  Providers of buy now, pay later products",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 195,
      "values:originalText": "(1) In this clause, where a data holder in the banking sector offers a covered product\nthat is a buy now, pay later product (a BNPL product), its BNPL date is the date\nthat it first offered a BNPL product.\n(2) These rules apply in relation to such a data holder with a BNPL date that is on or\nbefore the tranche 1 date, in respect of CDR data that relates to a BNPL product,\nas set out in the following table:\nApplication to data holder with BNPL date on or before the tranche 1 date,\nin respect of CDR data that relates to a BNPL product\nColumn 1\nType of request\nColumn 2\nApplication of rules\nA product data request under\nPart 2 of these rules\nOn and after the tranche 1 date\nA consumer data request\nunder Part 4 of these rules,\nother than a complex request\nOn and after the tranche 2 date\n(3) These rules apply in relation to such a data holder with a BNPL date that is\nbetween 14 July 2026 and 10 May 2027, in respect of CDR data that relates to a\nBNPL product, as set out in the following table:\n\nSchedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors"
    },
    {
