      "skos:definition": "(2) These rules apply in relation to such a data holder with a BNPL date that is on or\nbefore the tranche 1 date, in respect of CDR data that relates to a BNPL product,\nas set out in the following table:\nApplication to data holder with BNPL date on or before the tranche 1 date,\nin respect of CDR data that relates to a BNPL product\nColumn 1\nType of request\nColumn 2\nApplication of rules\nA product data request under\nPart 2 of these rules\nOn and after the tranche 1 date\nA consumer data request\nunder Part 4 of these rules,\nother than a complex request\nOn and after the tranche 2 date",
