    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-6-25",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6 12  CDR data relating to trial products",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-6-25"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.198",
      "values:originalText": "(1) These rules do not apply in respect of banking sector data or NBL sector data\nthat relates to a trial product, while the product is a trial product.\n(2) If a covered product ceases to be a trial product under subclause 1.5(2), these\nrules apply in respect of banking sector data or NBL sector data relating to that\nproduct (including such data generated while the product was a trial product).\n\nProvisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors  Schedule 3\nOther rules and modifications of these rules, for the banking sector and NBL sector  Part 7\nClause 7.1A\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020",
      "skos:definition": "(1) These rules do not apply in respect of banking sector data or NBL sector data\nthat relates to a trial product, while the product is a trial product.\n(2) If a covered product ceases to be a trial product under subclause 1.5(2), these\nrules apply in respect of banking sector data or NBL sector data relating to that\nproduct (including such data generated while the product was a trial product).\n\nProvisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors  Schedule 3\nOther rules and modifications of these rules, for the banking sector and NBL sector  Part 7\nClause 7.1A\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020",
