    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-7-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 1A  Transfer of data sharing obligations between data holders",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-7-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.199",
      "values:originalText": "(1) A data holder in the banking sector or NBL sector (the first data holder) may\nelect to comply with these rules in the place of another data holder in the banking\nsector or NBL sector (the second data holder), in relation to a covered product,\nif:\n(a) either:\n(i) the second data holder offers the product on behalf of the first data\nholder, such that the first data holder is the data holder that enters into\ncontracts with consumers to provide the product; or\n(ii) the first and second data holders are related bodies corporate for the\npurposes of the Act (see subsection 4A(5) of the Act); and\n(b) both data holders have agreed to the election in writing.\n(2) If an election is in effect under subclause (1), these rules apply in relation to the\nfirst data holder in relation to the covered product as if it were the second data\nholder.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) A data holder in the banking sector or NBL sector (the first data holder) may\nelect to comply with these rules in the place of another data holder in the banking\nsector or NBL sector (the second data holder), in relation to a covered product,\nif:\n(a) either:\n(i) the second data holder offers the product on behalf of the first data\nholder, such that the first data holder is the data holder that enters into\ncontracts with consumers to provide the product; or\n(ii) the first and second data holders are related bodies corporate for the\npurposes of the Act (see subsection 4A(5) of the Act); and\n(b) both data holders have agreed to the election in writing.\n(2) If an election is in effect under subclause (1), these rules apply in relation to the\nfirst data holder in relation to the covered product as if it were the second data\nholder.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-7-7-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-7-7-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "261cb77e35aea790692f6001318c676f184e221da7e12d976edfae5f33f3f515"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-7-7",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 1A  Transfer of data sharing obligations between data holders",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 199,
      "values:originalText": "(1) A data holder in the banking sector or NBL sector (the first data holder) may\nelect to comply with these rules in the place of another data holder in the banking\nsector or NBL sector (the second data holder), in relation to a covered product,\nif:\n(a) either:\n(i) the second data holder offers the product on behalf of the first data\nholder, such that the first data holder is the data holder that enters into\ncontracts with consumers to provide the product; or\n(ii) the first and second data holders are related bodies corporate for the\npurposes of the Act (see subsection 4A(5) of the Act); and\n(b) both data holders have agreed to the election in writing.\n(2) If an election is in effect under subclause (1), these rules apply in relation to the\nfirst data holder in relation to the covered product as if it were the second data\nholder."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-7-7-ss-1",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7(1) 1A  Transfer of data sharing obligations between data holders",
