      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.199",
      "values:originalText": "(2) If an election is in effect under subclause (1), these rules apply in relation to the\nfirst data holder in relation to the covered product as if it were the second data\nholder.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) If an election is in effect under subclause (1), these rules apply in relation to the\nfirst data holder in relation to the covered product as if it were the second data\nholder.",
      "values:partOf": {
