    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-7-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 2  Conditions for accredited person to be data holder",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-7-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.199",
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of paragraph 56AJ(4)(c) of the Act, the following conditions are\nspecified:\n(a) the person is an ADI or a relevant non-bank lender; and\n(aa) under Part 6 of this Schedule, these rules already apply to the person in\ntheir capacity as a data holder of other CDR data; and\n(b) the accredited person has collected CDR data, or any data directly or\nindirectly derived from CDR data (together, the relevant CDR data), in\naccordance with a collection consent;\n(c) the accredited person reasonably believes that the relevant CDR data is\nrelevant to its supply of a product to the CDR consumer, for that data;\n(d) either:\n(i) the conditions specified in subclause (2); or\n(ii) the conditions specified in subclause (2A).\nConditions involving notification prior to first collection\n(2) For subparagraph (1)(d)(i), the conditions are:\n(a) either:\n\nSchedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors",
      "skos:definition": "(1) For the purposes of paragraph 56AJ(4)(c) of the Act, the following conditions are\nspecified:\n(a) the person is an ADI or a relevant non-bank lender; and\n(aa) under Part 6 of this Schedule, these rules already apply to the person in\ntheir capacity as a data holder of other CDR data; and\n(b) the accredited person has collected CDR data, or any data directly or\nindirectly derived from CDR data (together, the relevant CDR data), in\naccordance with a collection consent;\n(c) the accredited person reasonably believes that the relevant CDR data is\nrelevant to its supply of a product to the CDR consumer, for that data;\n(d) either:\n(i) the conditions specified in subclause (2); or\n(ii) the conditions specified in subclause (2A).\nConditions involving notification prior to first collection\n(2) For subparagraph (1)(d)(i), the conditions are:\n(a) either:\n\nSchedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-7-9-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-7-9-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "32d574fdfe69cca220a2f854c79f49d3c02de4acdaf512524dd9491e8b3b3cd9"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-7-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 2  Conditions for accredited person to be data holder",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 199,
      "values:originalText": "(1) For the purposes of paragraph 56AJ(4)(c) of the Act, the following conditions are\nspecified:\n(a) the person is an ADI or a relevant non-bank lender; and\n(aa) under Part 6 of this Schedule, these rules already apply to the person in\ntheir capacity as a data holder of other CDR data; and\n(b) the accredited person has collected CDR data, or any data directly or\nindirectly derived from CDR data (together, the relevant CDR data), in\naccordance with a collection consent;\n(c) the accredited person reasonably believes that the relevant CDR data is\nrelevant to its supply of a product to the CDR consumer, for that data;\n(d) either:\n(i) the conditions specified in subclause (2); or\n(ii) the conditions specified in subclause (2A).\nConditions involving notification prior to first collection\n(2) For subparagraph (1)(d)(i), the conditions are:\n(a) either:\n\nSchedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors"
    },
