      "skos:note": "Criteria for streamlined accreditation in the banking sector"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-7-10",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 3  Streamlined accreditation—banking sector",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 200,
      "values:originalText": "For paragraph 5.5(b) of these rules, for the banking sector, the criteria for\nstreamlined accreditation are that the accreditation applicant:\n\nProvisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors  Schedule 3\nOther rules and modifications of these rules, for the banking sector and NBL sector  Part 7\nClause 7.4\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\n(a) is an ADI; but\n(b) is not a restricted ADI."
    },
