      "values:originalText": "(1) This clause sets out how the accreditation criteria operate in relation to the\nbanking sector, for the purposes of rule 5.12 of these rules.\n(2) An accredited person that:\n(a) is an ADI; but\n(b) is not a restricted ADI;\nneed not comply with paragraph 5.12(2)(b) of these rules."
