      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.201",
      "values:originalText": "banking sector\nFor item 5 of the table in rule 5.17:\n(b) the relevant condition is that the accredited person was, at the time of the\naccreditation, an ADI; and\n(c) the accredited person ceases to satisfy the condition if its authority to carry\non banking business is no longer in force.\n\nSchedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors",
      "skos:definition": "banking sector\nFor item 5 of the table in rule 5.17:\n(b) the relevant condition is that the accredited person was, at the time of the\naccreditation, an ADI; and\n(c) the accredited person ceases to satisfy the condition if its authority to carry\non banking business is no longer in force.\n\nSchedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-7-12-norm"
        },
