        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-7-12-logic-cogai-5"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "533cf50ab15d2a0fea81abc9b36bec1c1bab31b6a738a333a2029d9a3fd76edc",
      "skos:note": "Condition for accreditation to cease if authority is no longer in force."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-7-12",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 5  Grounds for revocation, suspension and surrender of accreditation—",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 201,
      "values:originalText": "banking sector\nFor item 5 of the table in rule 5.17:\n(b) the relevant condition is that the accredited person was, at the time of the\naccreditation, an ADI; and\n(c) the accredited person ceases to satisfy the condition if its authority to carry\non banking business is no longer in force.\n\nSchedule 3  Provisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors"
    },
