    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-4",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8(4) 1  Moving from the NBL sector to the banking sector",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-4"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.202",
      "values:originalText": "(4) Despite anything else in this Schedule, the data holder must respond to the\nrequest in accordance with Part 2 or Part 4 as the case requires.\nNote:\nIf the data holder has become a restricted ADI, it will be an excluded ADI, and this\nprovision will override clause 1.1A. If it becomes an unrestricted ADI, this provision\nwill override the allowance of time in clause 6.9.\nCDR consumer must be notified of change of sector",
      "skos:definition": "(4) Despite anything else in this Schedule, the data holder must respond to the\nrequest in accordance with Part 2 or Part 4 as the case requires.\nNote:\nIf the data holder has become a restricted ADI, it will be an excluded ADI, and this\nprovision will override clause 1.1A. If it becomes an unrestricted ADI, this provision\nwill override the allowance of time in clause 6.9.\nCDR consumer must be notified of change of sector",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-4-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-4-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "cd9136d4bd6884744d834bbc3abfa9b32fadc63023b2677ad0bfe30870fd588f",
      "skos:note": "Must respond to request in accordance with Part 2 or Part 4 as required."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-4",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8(4) 1  Moving from the NBL sector to the banking sector",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 202,
      "values:originalText": "(4) Despite anything else in this Schedule, the data holder must respond to the\nrequest in accordance with Part 2 or Part 4 as the case requires.\nNote:\nIf the data holder has become a restricted ADI, it will be an excluded ADI, and this\nprovision will override clause 1.1A. If it becomes an unrestricted ADI, this provision\nwill override the allowance of time in clause 6.9.\nCDR consumer must be notified of change of sector"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-4-norm",
