    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8(5) 1  Moving from the NBL sector to the banking sector",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.202",
      "values:originalText": "(5) As soon as practicable after the transition time, the data holder must give a\nwritten notification to each CDR consumer in respect of whom a request\nmentioned in subclause (1) is on foot that:\n(a) the data holder has ceased to operate in the NBL sector; and\n(b) the data holder is now operating in the banking sector; and\n(c) the data requested is now banking sector data; and\n\nProvisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors  Schedule 3\nEntities that move from NBL sector to banking sector  Part 8\nClause 8.1\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\n(d) the CDR consumer may, under rule 4.13, 4.20J or 4.25, choose to withdraw\nan authorisation or consent given under Part 4 in respect of the request.",
      "skos:definition": "(5) As soon as practicable after the transition time, the data holder must give a\nwritten notification to each CDR consumer in respect of whom a request\nmentioned in subclause (1) is on foot that:\n(a) the data holder has ceased to operate in the NBL sector; and\n(b) the data holder is now operating in the banking sector; and\n(c) the data requested is now banking sector data; and\n\nProvisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors  Schedule 3\nEntities that move from NBL sector to banking sector  Part 8\nClause 8.1\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\n(d) the CDR consumer may, under rule 4.13, 4.20J or 4.25, choose to withdraw\nan authorisation or consent given under Part 4 in respect of the request.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-5-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-5-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "a9c9c606eaf455103c27f8d94c09c7db08538601c83e36562411bd0dc827af1f",
      "skos:note": "Notify CDR consumer of data holder's transition to banking sector",
      "dc:description": "written notification"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8(5) 1  Moving from the NBL sector to the banking sector",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 202,
      "values:originalText": "(5) As soon as practicable after the transition time, the data holder must give a\nwritten notification to each CDR consumer in respect of whom a request\nmentioned in subclause (1) is on foot that:\n(a) the data holder has ceased to operate in the NBL sector; and\n(b) the data holder is now operating in the banking sector; and\n(c) the data requested is now banking sector data; and\n\nProvisions relevant to the banking and non-bank lenders sectors  Schedule 3\nEntities that move from NBL sector to banking sector  Part 8\nClause 8.1\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\n(d) the CDR consumer may, under rule 4.13, 4.20J or 4.25, choose to withdraw\nan authorisation or consent given under Part 4 in respect of the request."
    },
