      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.202",
      "values:originalText": "(6) As soon as practicable after the transition time, the data holder must give a\nwritten notification to each accredited person who made a consumer data request\nmentioned in subclause (1) that:\n(a) the data holder has ceased to operate in the NBL sector; and\n(b) the data holder is now operating in the banking sector.",
      "skos:definition": "(6) As soon as practicable after the transition time, the data holder must give a\nwritten notification to each accredited person who made a consumer data request\nmentioned in subclause (1) that:\n(a) the data holder has ceased to operate in the NBL sector; and\n(b) the data holder is now operating in the banking sector.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
