    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-6",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "8(6) 1  Moving from the NBL sector to the banking sector",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 202,
      "values:originalText": "(6) As soon as practicable after the transition time, the data holder must give a\nwritten notification to each accredited person who made a consumer data request\nmentioned in subclause (1) that:\n(a) the data holder has ceased to operate in the NBL sector; and\n(b) the data holder is now operating in the banking sector."
    },
