    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-7",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8(7) 1  Moving from the NBL sector to the banking sector",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-3-sec-8-2-ss-7"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.202",
      "values:originalText": "(7) Where an accredited person would be required to update the consumer dashboard\nof a relevant CDR consumer under rule 4.19 as a result of the sector change\nmentioned in subclause (1), the accredited person must instead update the\nconsumer dashboard within a reasonable period after receiving the notification\nmentioned in subclause (6).\n\nSchedule 4  Provisions relevant to the energy sector",
      "skos:definition": "(7) Where an accredited person would be required to update the consumer dashboard\nof a relevant CDR consumer under rule 4.19 as a result of the sector change\nmentioned in subclause (1), the accredited person must instead update the\nconsumer dashboard within a reasonable period after receiving the notification\nmentioned in subclause (6).\n\nSchedule 4  Provisions relevant to the energy sector",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-3-sec-8-2"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
