    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-41",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "1 3  Meaning of terms for types of data",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-1-41"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.206",
      "values:originalText": "For this Schedule, a term listed in column 1 of the table has the meaning given\nby column 2.\nMeaning of customer data, account data, billing data, metering data, NMI standing data, DER\nregister data, product specific data and tailored tariff data\nColumn 1\nColumn 2\ncustomer data, in\nrelation to a\nparticular person\n(a) means information that identifies or is about the person; and\n(b) includes:\n(i)    the person’s name; and\n(ii)   the person’s contact details, including their:\n(A) telephone number; and\n(B) email address; and\n(C) physical address; and\n(iii)  any information that:\n(A) the person provided at the time of acquiring a particular\nproduct; and\n(B) relates to their eligibility to acquire that product; and\n(iv)  if the person operates a business—the following:\n(A) the person’s business name;\n(B) the person’s ABN; and\n(c) if the person is an individual―does not include the person’s date\nof birth.\naccount data, in\nrelation to a\nparticular account\n(a) means information that identifies or is about the operation of the\naccount; and\n(b) includes:\n(i)    the account number, other than to the extent that an\naccount number is masked (whether as required by law or\nin accordance with any applicable standard or industry\npractice); and\n(ii)   the date the account was created; and\n\nProvisions relevant to the energy sector  Schedule 4\nPreliminary  Part 1\nClause 1.3\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\nMeaning of customer data, account data, billing data, metering data, NMI standing data, DER\nregister data, product specific data and tailored tariff data\nColumn 1\nColumn 2\n(iii)  the unique identifiers that represent the connection points\nassociated with the account; and\n(iv)  any payment schedule associated with the account\n(including payment method and frequency of payments);\nand\n(v)   any concessions, rebates or grants applied to the account;\nand\n(c) does not include information about whether the account is\nassociated with a hardship program.\nbilling data, in\nrelation to a\nparticular account\nmeans:\n(a) information about a bill that has been issued in relation to the\narrangement to which the account relates, including:\n(i)    the account number; and\n(ii)   the billing period; and\n(iii)  the date the bill was issued; and\n(iv)  the total amount payable; and\n(v)   the tariffs and charges applicable; and\n(vi)  details of consumption or estimated consumption of\nenergy; and\n(b) information about a payment or other transaction made in relation\nto the arrangement, including:\n(i)    the nature of the transaction; and\n(ii)   the date and time of the transaction; and\n(iii)  the amount paid; and\n(iv)  the payment method; and\n(c) the account balance at any time.\nmetering data, in\nrelation to a\nparticular account\nmeans metering data, other than metering data for a type 7 metering\ninstallation, within the meaning given by the National Electricity\nRules, that relates to the account.\nNMI standing data,\nin relation to a\nparticular account\nmeans NMI standing data, within the meaning given by the National\nElectricity Rules, that relates to a connection point associated with the\naccount.\nDER register data,\nin relation to a\nparticular account\n(a) means DER register information, within the meaning given by the\nNational Electricity Rules, for DER that relate to the account; and\n(b) includes:\n(i)    the unique identifier for each connection point associated\nwith the metering data that relates to the DER; and\n(ii)   the approved small generating unit capacity as agreed with\na network service provider in the connection agreement;\nand\n(iii)  the number of phases available for the installation of\nDER; and\n(iv)  the number of phases the DER are connected to; and\n\nSchedule 4  Provisions relevant to the energy sector",
      "skos:definition": "For this Schedule, a term listed in column 1 of the table has the meaning given\nby column 2.\nMeaning of customer data, account data, billing data, metering data, NMI standing data, DER\nregister data, product specific data and tailored tariff data\nColumn 1\nColumn 2\ncustomer data, in\nrelation to a\nparticular person\n(a) means information that identifies or is about the person; and\n(b) includes:\n(i)    the person’s name; and\n(ii)   the person’s contact details, including their:\n(A) telephone number; and\n(B) email address; and\n(C) physical address; and\n(iii)  any information that:\n(A) the person provided at the time of acquiring a particular\nproduct; and\n(B) relates to their eligibility to acquire that product; and\n(iv)  if the person operates a business—the following:\n(A) the person’s business name;\n(B) the person’s ABN; and\n(c) if the person is an individual―does not include the person’s date\nof birth.\naccount data, in\nrelation to a\nparticular account\n(a) means information that identifies or is about the operation of the\naccount; and\n(b) includes:\n(i)    the account number, other than to the extent that an\naccount number is masked (whether as required by law or\nin accordance with any applicable standard or industry\npractice); and\n(ii)   the date the account was created; and\n\nProvisions relevant to the energy sector  Schedule 4\nPreliminary  Part 1\nClause 1.3\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\nMeaning of customer data, account data, billing data, metering data, NMI standing data, DER\nregister data, product specific data and tailored tariff data\nColumn 1\nColumn 2\n(iii)  the unique identifiers that represent the connection points\nassociated with the account; and\n(iv)  any payment schedule associated with the account\n(including payment method and frequency of payments);\nand\n(v)   any concessions, rebates or grants applied to the account;\nand\n(c) does not include information about whether the account is\nassociated with a hardship program.\nbilling data,",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-41-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-41-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-1-41-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "13203be059cf4c30da85bbb9101ba2f869c82ef22b78f4a48ba44f897846dd61",
      "skos:note": "Defines customer data, account data, billing data, metering data, NMI standing data, DER register data, product specific data and tailored tariff data."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-1-41",
