      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.210",
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the energy sector, a person has account privileges in relation to an account\nwith a retailer if the person is a customer authorised representative of the account\nholder for the purposes of:\n(a) rule 56A of the National Energy Retail Rules; or\n(b) Chapter 7 of the National Electricity Rules.",
      "skos:definition": "(2) For the energy sector, a person has account privileges in relation to an account\nwith a retailer if the person is a customer authorised representative of the account\nholder for the purposes of:\n(a) rule 56A of the National Energy Retail Rules; or\n(b) Chapter 7 of the National Electricity Rules.",
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-2-11"
      },
      "cml:asserts": [
