      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.211",
      "values:originalText": "sector\n(1) In this clause:\nrelevant account, in relation to a CDR consumer, means an account for which\nthe CDR consumer is an account holder or secondary user and is:\n(a) an account held by the CDR consumer in their name alone; or\n(b) a joint account; or\n(c) a partnership account.\n\nSchedule 4  Provisions relevant to the energy sector",
      "skos:definition": "sector\n(1) In this clause:\nrelevant account, in relation to a CDR consumer, means an account for which\nthe CDR consumer is an account holder or secondary user and is:\n(a) an account held by the CDR consumer in their name alone; or\n(b) a joint account; or\n(c) a partnership account.\n\nSchedule 4  Provisions relevant to the energy sector",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-3-11-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "13cc028d0f18ae99abb7fe652ea74408c92e52d3329b9f40690651f0739b62fe",
      "skos:note": "Defines relevant account for CDR consumer in energy sector"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-3-11",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "3 2  Meaning of required consumer data and voluntary consumer data—energy",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 211,
      "values:originalText": "sector\n(1) In this clause:\nrelevant account, in relation to a CDR consumer, means an account for which\nthe CDR consumer is an account holder or secondary user and is:\n(a) an account held by the CDR consumer in their name alone; or\n(b) a joint account; or\n(c) a partnership account.\n\nSchedule 4  Provisions relevant to the energy sector"
