    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-93",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4 2  Product data request service",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-93"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.214",
      "values:originalText": "(1) Despite rule 1.12, a data holder of energy sector data, other than the AER and the\nVictorian agency, is not required to provide a product data request service.\n(2) However, if such a data holder chooses to provide an online service that can be\nused to make product data requests, the service must comply with rule 1.12.",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Despite rule 1.12, a data holder of energy sector data, other than the AER and the\nVictorian agency, is not required to provide a product data request service.\n(2) However, if such a data holder chooses to provide an online service that can be\nused to make product data requests, the service must comply with rule 1.12.",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-93-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-93-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "d57c1d2bc58e54868a77f1e38410962830ada551397b01e6cdbce0c6c773643b"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-93",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 2  Product data request service",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 214,
      "values:originalText": "(1) Despite rule 1.12, a data holder of energy sector data, other than the AER and the\nVictorian agency, is not required to provide a product data request service.\n(2) However, if such a data holder chooses to provide an online service that can be\nused to make product data requests, the service must comply with rule 1.12."
    },
