    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-94",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "4 3  Meaning of SR data and primary data holder—energy sector",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-94"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.214",
      "values:originalText": "For these rules:\n(a) SR data, in relation to the energy sector, means AEMO data in relation to a\nCDR consumer; and\n(b) the primary data holder for the SR data is the relevant retailer.\nNote:\nParagraph (a) also makes AEMO the secondary data holder for the SR data.",
      "skos:definition": "For these rules:\n(a) SR data, in relation to the energy sector, means AEMO data in relation to a\nCDR consumer; and\n(b) the primary data holder for the SR data is the relevant retailer.\nNote:\nParagraph (a) also makes AEMO the secondary data holder for the SR data.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-94-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-94-logic-deontic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-94-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "2206be6212f509899182e6defe12867bf30598ce038aef7932d09c3e20a6eccb",
      "skos:note": "Defines SR data and primary data holder for the energy sector."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-4-94",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "4 3  Meaning of SR data and primary data holder—energy sector",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 214,
      "values:originalText": "For these rules:\n(a) SR data, in relation to the energy sector, means AEMO data in relation to a\nCDR consumer; and\n(b) the primary data holder for the SR data is the relevant retailer.\nNote:\nParagraph (a) also makes AEMO the secondary data holder for the SR data."
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-4-94-norm",
