    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-5-42-ss-2",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "5(2) 1  Meeting internal dispute resolution requirements—energy sector",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 215,
      "values:originalText": "(2) For the energy sector, a retailer (including a retailer that is also an accredited\nperson) meets the internal dispute resolution requirements if its internal dispute\nresolution processes satisfy the applicable requirements for the retailer’s standard\ncomplaints and dispute resolution procedures under the National Energy Retail\nLaw or the Energy Retail Code (Victoria)."
