      "values:originalText": "(1) For the energy sector, persons of the following kinds meet the external dispute\nresolution requirements in the circumstances indicated:\n(a) an accredited person that is not a retailer—if it is an AFCA member;\n(b) a retailer that is not an accredited person—if it is an EWO member;\n(c) an accredited person that is also a retailer, but not a limited retailer—if it is\nboth an AFCA member and an EWO member;\n(d) an accredited person that is also a limited retailer—if it is an EWO\nmember.\nMeaning of AFCA member"
