      },
      "cml:premiseText": "Retailer uses energy sector CDR data only for energy sector purposes",
      "cml:conclusionText": "Retailer is a limited retailer"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-6-5",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "6 1  Responding to correction request (rule 7.15)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-6-5"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.218",
      "values:originalText": "(1) This clause applies to a retailer that receives a request under subsection 56EP(1)\nor (2) of the Act that relates to AEMO data.\n(2) In relation to the AEMO data, rule 7.15 applies as if paragraphs (b) and (c) were\nreplaced by the following:\n“ (b) as soon as practicable:\n(i) initiate the relevant correction procedures under the National\nElectricity Rules in relation to any NMI standing data or metering\ndata for which correction is requested; and\n(ii) if the request relates to DER register data, provide the requester with\ninformation about how the requester can contact the distributor to\nhave the data corrected.”.\n\nProvisions relevant to the energy sector  Schedule 4\nReporting and record keeping—energy sector  Part 7\nClause 7.1\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020",
      "skos:definition": "(1) This clause applies to a retailer that receives a request under subsection 56EP(1)\nor (2) of the Act that relates to AEMO data.\n(2) In relation to the AEMO data, rule 7.15 applies as if paragraphs (b) and (c) were\nreplaced by the following:\n“ (b) as soon as practicable:\n(i) initiate the relevant correction procedures under the National\nElectricity Rules in relation to any NMI standing data or metering\ndata for which correction is requested; and\n(ii) if the request relates to DER register data, provide the requester with\ninformation about how the requester can contact the distributor to\nhave the data corrected.”.\n\nProvisions relevant to the energy sector  Schedule 4\nReporting and record keeping—energy sector  Part 7\nClause 7.1\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020",
      "cml:hasPart": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-6-5-ss-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-6-5-ss-2"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "4384cf72742e7b1a566258e02947ba63f0e29a386a5b62ce8d6bb76be4d67e28"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-6-5",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "6 1  Responding to correction request (rule 7.15)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 218,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This clause applies to a retailer that receives a request under subsection 56EP(1)\nor (2) of the Act that relates to AEMO data.\n(2) In relation to the AEMO data, rule 7.15 applies as if paragraphs (b) and (c) were\nreplaced by the following:\n“ (b) as soon as practicable:\n(i) initiate the relevant correction procedures under the National\nElectricity Rules in relation to any NMI standing data or metering\ndata for which correction is requested; and\n(ii) if the request relates to DER register data, provide the requester with\ninformation about how the requester can contact the distributor to\nhave the data corrected.”.\n\nProvisions relevant to the energy sector  Schedule 4\nReporting and record keeping—energy sector  Part 7\nClause 7.1\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020"
    },
