    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-24",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "7 1  Reporting requirements (rule 9.4)",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-7-24"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.219",
      "values:originalText": "Rule 9.4 applies to AER and the Victorian agency as if subrule 9.4(1) were\nreplaced by the following, referring to either as “the Agency”:\n“(1) The Agency must prepare a report for each reporting period that:\n(a) is in the form approved by the Commission for the purposes of this rule;\nand\n(b) sets out the number (if any) of product data requests received by the\nAgency during the reporting period; and\n(c) sets out:\n(i) the number of times the Agency refused to disclose CDR data; and\n(ii) the rule or data standard relied upon to refuse to disclose that data;\nand\n(iii) the number of times the Agency has relied on each of those rules or\ndata standards as a ground of refusal.”.\n\nSchedule 4  Provisions relevant to the energy sector",
      "skos:definition": "Rule 9.4 applies to AER and the Victorian agency as if subrule 9.4(1) were\nreplaced by the following, referring to either as “the Agency”:\n“(1) The Agency must prepare a report for each reporting period that:\n(a) is in the form approved by the Commission for the purposes of this rule;\nand\n(b) sets out the number (if any) of product data requests received by the\nAgency during the reporting period; and\n(c) sets out:\n(i) the number of times the Agency refused to disclose CDR data; and\n(ii) the rule or data standard relied upon to refuse to disclose that data;\nand\n(iii) the number of times the Agency has relied on each of those rules or\ndata standards as a ground of refusal.”.\n\nSchedule 4  Provisions relevant to the energy sector",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-24-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-24-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "077f09e3a636784bd33e484e60f1b1421e97c4f55e35c781d4f86edebb5c767d",
      "skos:note": "The Agency must prepare a report for each reporting period.",
      "dc:description": "Yes"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-7-24",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "7 1  Reporting requirements (rule 9.4)",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 219,
      "values:originalText": "Rule 9.4 applies to AER and the Victorian agency as if subrule 9.4(1) were\nreplaced by the following, referring to either as “the Agency”:\n“(1) The Agency must prepare a report for each reporting period that:\n(a) is in the form approved by the Commission for the purposes of this rule;\nand\n(b) sets out the number (if any) of product data requests received by the\nAgency during the reporting period; and\n(c) sets out:\n(i) the number of times the Agency refused to disclose CDR data; and\n(ii) the rule or data standard relied upon to refuse to disclose that data;\nand\n(iii) the number of times the Agency has relied on each of those rules or\ndata standards as a ground of refusal.”.\n\nSchedule 4  Provisions relevant to the energy sector"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-24-norm",
      "@type": "values:Obligation",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "values:partOf": {
        "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-24"
      },
      "values:deonticStatus": {
        "@id": "values:HeuristicDerived"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "values:borneBy": {
        "@id": "values:Agent"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-7-24-logic-deontic-1",
      "@type": "cml:LogicApplication",
      "cml:modality": {
        "@id": "cml:Deontic"
      },
      "cml:operator": "MUST",
      "cml:logicSummary": "The Agency must prepare a report.",
      "cml:executionSurface": "modalities::logic::deontic",
      "cml:confidence": {
        "@value": 1.0,
        "@type": "xsd:decimal"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-20",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "8 1  Interpretation",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010#sch-4-sec-8-20"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.220",
      "values:originalText": "In this Part:\ncomplex request means a consumer data request that:\n(a) is made on behalf of a large customer; or\n(b) is made on behalf of a secondary user; or\n(c) relates to a joint account or a partnership account; or\n(d) is made on behalf of a CDR consumer who has a nominated representative.\ninitial retailer has the meaning given by clause 8.2.\nlarge customer means a CDR consumer that is:\n(a) in relation to a retailer that is subject to the Electricity Industry Act 2000\n(Vic)—a customer that is not a relevant customer for the purposes of that\nAct; or\n(b) otherwise—a large customer for the purposes of the National Energy Retail\nLaw.\nlarger retailer has the meaning given by clause 8.3.\nsmall retailer means a retailer that is not either an initial retailer or a larger\nretailer.\ntranche 1 date means 15 November 2022.\ntranche 1 (VA) date means a date specified by the Minister in a notifiable\ninstrument made for the purposes of this definition.\ntranche 2 date means 15 May 2023.\ntranche 3 date means 1 November 2023.\ntranche 4 date means 1 May 2024.",
      "skos:definition": "In this Part:\ncomplex request means a consumer data request that:\n(a) is made on behalf of a large customer; or\n(b) is made on behalf of a secondary user; or\n(c) relates to a joint account or a partnership account; or\n(d) is made on behalf of a CDR consumer who has a nominated representative.\ninitial retailer has the meaning given by clause 8.2.\nlarge customer means a CDR consumer that is:\n(a) in relation to a retailer that is subject to the Electricity Industry Act 2000\n(Vic)—a customer that is not a relevant customer for the purposes of that\nAct; or\n(b) otherwise—a large customer for the purposes of the National Energy Retail\nLaw.\nlarger retailer has the meaning given by clause 8.3.\nsmall retailer means a retailer that is not either an initial retailer or a larger\nretailer.\ntranche 1 date means 15 November 2022.\ntranche 1 (VA) date means a date specified by the Minister in a notifiable\ninstrument made for the purposes of this definition.\ntranche 2 date means 15 May 2023.\ntranche 3 date means 1 November 2023.\ntranche 4 date means 1 May 2024.",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-20-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-20-logic-descriptionlogic-1"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010-sch-4-sec-8-20-logic-descriptionlogic-2"
        },
