      "dc:source": "made-under-the-competition-and-consumer-act-2010.pdf, p.220",
      "values:originalText": "In this Schedule, initial retailer means any of the following:\nThe AGL Energy Group\n(a) AGL Sales (Queensland Electricity) Pty Limited – ABN 66 078 875 902;\n(b) AGL South Australia Pty Ltd – ABN 49 091 105 092;\n(c) AGL Sales Pty Limited – ABN 88 090 538 337;\nThe Origin Energy Group\n(d) Origin Energy Electricity Limited – ABN 33 071 052 287;\n(e) any other subsidiary of Origin Energy Limited authorised or licensed to sell\nelectricity in the National Electricity Market;\n\nProvisions relevant to the energy sector  Schedule 4\nStaged application of these rules to the energy sector  Part 8\nClause 8.3\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\nThe Energy Australia Group\n(f) EnergyAustralia Pty Ltd – ABN 99 086 014 968.",
      "skos:definition": "In this Schedule, initial retailer means any of the following:\nThe AGL Energy Group\n(a) AGL Sales (Queensland Electricity) Pty Limited – ABN 66 078 875 902;\n(b) AGL South Australia Pty Ltd – ABN 49 091 105 092;\n(c) AGL Sales Pty Limited – ABN 88 090 538 337;\nThe Origin Energy Group\n(d) Origin Energy Electricity Limited – ABN 33 071 052 287;\n(e) any other subsidiary of Origin Energy Limited authorised or licensed to sell\nelectricity in the National Electricity Market;\n\nProvisions relevant to the energy sector  Schedule 4\nStaged application of these rules to the energy sector  Part 8\nClause 8.3\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020\nThe Energy Australia Group\n(f) EnergyAustralia Pty Ltd – ABN 99 086 014 968.",
