      "cof:title": "8(1) 7  Authorisation to disclose CDR data before being required to do so",
      "values:kind": "subsection",
      "cof:pageNumber": 222,
      "values:originalText": "(1) This clause applies in relation to a request for disclosure of CDR data that has\nbeen made to a retailer in accordance with Part 2, Part 3 or Part 4 of these rules\n(the relevant data request Part) if:\n(b) the requested CDR data is any of the following:\n(i) required product data;\n(ii) voluntary product data;\n(iii) required consumer data;\n(iv) voluntary consumer data; and\n(c) the requested CDR data includes some pre-application CDR data.\n\nProvisions relevant to the energy sector  Schedule 4\nStaged application of these rules to the energy sector  Part 8\nClause 8.7\nCompetition and Consumer (Consumer Data Right) Rules 2020"
    },
