      "cml:integrityHash": "e439386ade1f9e3bab601a899b90b330e3d59b5bae0e3087120ebaaa1144ec09",
      "skos:note": "Accredited person must cease to satisfy the condition if its authorisation or licence to sell electricity in the National Electricity Market has been suspended or revoked."
