      "cml:premiseText": "The accredited person must cease to satisfy the condition if its authorisation or licence to sell electricity in the National Electricity Market has been suspended or revoked.",
      "cml:conclusionText": "If the accredited person ceases to satisfy the condition, it implies that its authorisation or licence has been suspended or revoked."
    },
